<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">Sakachep: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">John</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thurchisa JOHN Miziek dungjûiin</para>
  <para style="toc2">John</para>
  <para style="toc3">Joh</para>
  <para style="mt2">Thurchisa</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOHN</para>
  <para style="mt2">Miziek Dungjûiin</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chongmaruoi</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Thurchisa John miziek dungjûiin</char> Jisua hih kumtuonga Pathien Chong, “Munisi juong changa ei lâia a omsaipu hih ani,” ti mi min riet ani (1:14). Hi lekhabu lelê hin ati anghan, hi Thurchisa hih miziek anina, abitak chu aporepungei murdi'n Jisua hih Sanminringpu leikhâmsai Pathien Nâipasal, ani ti an iem theina rang le ma an iemna sika ringna an man theina ranga ani (20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kumtuonga Pathien Chong leh Jisua nina ânzom tie roi hi chongmaruoia ânlang suole chu hi lekhabu bul tienga ei mu Jisua hi Sanminringpu leikhâmsai, Pathien Nâipasal ani minlangna sininkhêl tamtak ngeia minlang ani. Mangei ha sininkhêl minlanga omin rilminthârna chongin ajûi sa. Hi muna hin chu mi senkhatin Jisua an iema, ama jûipungei an hong nitie ngei le senkhatin chu ama an doia, iem nuom mak ngei tiin a misîr ani. Abung 13-17 sûnga hin chu Jisua sûra a omni jâna a ruoisingei leh an intûp khomna roi le jêmdela a om rangtoa an kôma incherêlna chong le mohôkna chong a pêk ngei hah achuong ani. Abung mongna tieng ngeia hin chu Jisua sûra a om roi le a chungroi an jêkna roi ngei, an jêmdelna roi le ânthoinôkna roi le ânthoinôk suonûka a ruoisingei kôm ânlârna thurchi ngei hih misîrin aom ani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nupangnu ânre lâitaka an sûrnu thurchi (8:1-11) hi chu kuolkhum sûnga dar ani, asik chu kuta miziek tamtak ngeia le chongmelet masa ngeia han an lei minchuong loi sika ani, senkhat nôkin chu mun danga an miziek minchuong ani.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">John</char> hin Khrista jâra kumtuong ringna manboipêk, Jisua chu lampui, chongtak le ringna ani, tia ama iem ngei kaiin atûn renga an man rang manboipêk lunghâng a tho ani. Hi Thurchisa <char style="bk">John </char>miziek hih rathatienga adiktaka riet minthârna ei dôn theina rangin anîngtin ringnuna ei mang uol ngâi neinunngei, tui, vâipôl, vâr, belripu le a belringei, male graperâng le amarangei mangin chong mi mintêk pe sika ani.</para>
  <para style="is1">Asûnga chongtângpuingei</para>
  <para style="io1">Chongmaruoi <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:1-18">1:1-18</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Baptispu John le Jisua ruoisi masa ngei <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-51">1:19-51</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Jisua mipuingei ranga sintho <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-12:50">2:1—12:50</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Sûn mongna tienga Jerusalem sûnga le akôla Jisua sintho <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 13:1-19:42">13:1—19:42</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pumapa inthoinôkna le ân lârnangei <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 20:1-31">20:1-31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Chongkhârna: Galilee rama ân lâr nôkna <char style="ior"><ref loc="JHN 21:1-25">21:1-25</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Ringna chong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>Aphutna taka han chong alei oma; ma chong ha Pathien kôm aoma, Chong ha ke Pathien ani. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Aphutna tak renga han chong hah Pathien kôm ke aom ani. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Neinunngei murdi Pathien sin riempet an nia, ama sin loi neinun inkhat luo omak. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Ma Chong ha ke ringna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chong ha ke ringna bulpui ani; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sina omngei ha chong leh inzomin ringna an dôn ani.</char></note> bulpui ani, male ma ringna hah munisi ngei minvârpu ani. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Ma vâr han ijîng a êlminvâra, ijîng han lei khap thei mak.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Pathien'n a thangtheipu inkhat a juong tîra, a riming chu John ani, <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mat 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:4">Mk 1:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1">Luk 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:2">2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>ha mi han vâr thurchi mingei min riet ranga juong ani, ama sikin mitinin an iem theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>Ama hah vâr chu nimaka; vâr thurchi mingei min riet ranga juong ani. <verse eid="JHN 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Mahi vâr diktak chu ani; rammuola a juonga mingei murdi minvârpu hi.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Chong hah rammuola aoma, male Pathien'n Chong mangin rammuol ha sin khomsenla, rammuolin lei riet thei maka. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>A mingei nanâk kôm a juonga, aniatachu a mingeiin lei modôm mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Hankhoma ama modôm ngei kai le ama iem ngei chu Pathien nâi nina a pêk ngei zoi. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Ha mingei hah chu thisena inzir nimak ngeia, taksa nuomlama ânzir khom nimak ngeia, munisi ngei pa nuomlama ânzir khom ni uol mak ngei; Pathien ha kêng an Pa ani.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Hanchu, Chong hah munisi juong changin, moroina le chongtaka sipin ei lâia a juong om zoi. A roiinpuina ei mua, Pathien Nâikhât roiinpuina a man hah.<verse eid="JHN 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>John'n a chungroi a misîra, ân ieka, Hi mi thurchi hih ki misîr ani, “Ku nûka juong rangpu hi keima nêka lien uol ani, kên zir mâna a lei om sai ani sikin,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>A lungkham satvurna akipin ei rêngin ei changa, moroina chunga moroi nôkna. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Pathien'n Balam chongpêk Moses a pêka, aniatachu moroina le chongtak chu Jisua Khrista sikin ahong om ani. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Tutên Pathien la mu mak ngeia. A Nâikhât vai, Pathien ân angpui le Pa tienga om ngêt han, a thurchi a min riet zoi.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Baptispu John chongbê</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Jerusalema Juda rachamneipungei han, “John, hah tumo ani?” ti rekel rangin ochaingei le Levi richisuonpârngei an tîra. <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>John'n ânthârtakin, “Messiah chu ni mu-ung” a lei tipe ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>“Nônte, Tumo ni ni? Elijah mo ni ni?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Bal 18:15</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 18:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 4:5">Mal 4:5</ref></char></note> tiin an rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Ni mu-ung,” tiin a thuon ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Dêipu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">dêipu ha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A juon lang ranga lei sabeipu inkhat ha male Messiah juong ranga lei phuong ha.</char></note> mo ni ni?” tiin an rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:21">“Ni mu-ung,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>“Nônte tumo ni ni? mi hongtîr ngei chong kin mele theina rangin mi ril roh. Nu thurchi hi i angin mo ni ti?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>John'n dêipu Isaiah chong mangin a thuona:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 1:23">“Keima hi ramchâra mi inkhat tânghâipu ha ki ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 1:23">Pumapa lônna rang lampui mintûn roi!”<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Ma thangtheipungei, Phariseengei hongtîr ngei han John an rekel nôka, <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>hanchu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hanchu, ma thangtheipungei, Phariseengeiin an hongtîr ngei hah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Phariseengei hongtîra omngei ha; anni ngei.</char></note> “Messiah ni ni noa, Elijah mo, Dêipu mo luo ni ni nônte ithomo mi na baptis ngâia?” tiin an rekela. <verse eid="JHN 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>John'n a thuona, “Keiman chu tui leh ka baptis'a, hannirese nin lâia hin nin riet loi mi inkhat ânding chiena. <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>Ama hah ku nûka a juong rang ania, kei chu a kekokrûi sût rang luon inhoi mu-ung,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Mangei hah Bethany khuo nisuo tieng Jordan tuidung râla, John'n a baptisna ngâi muna atung ani.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pathien Belrite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Anangtûka chu John'n Jisua a kôm hongin a mua male, “En ta u, Pathien Belrite rammuol sietna pêl rangpu soh,” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>Hi mi chungroi hih ani, “Mi ku nûka a juong a oma, aniatachu keima nêka lien uol ani, keima kên zir mâna a omsai ani sikin, ki ti hah. <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Tumo ani rang riet mu-ung, nikhomsenla, Israel mingei min riet rangin tuia baptis rangin ku juong ani.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Male John'n hi thurchi hih a misîra: “Ratha hah invân renga juong chumin vasu angin a chunga a juong chum ku mu. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>Atûntena keiman chu la riet thei mu-ung, nikhomrese tuia mi baptis ranga mi tîrpu Pathien'n, Ratha hah invân renga juong chumin mi inkhat chunga chuongin mini mûng na ta; ama hih Ratha Inthienga leh mi baptis rangpu ha ani.” <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>John'n, “Ama hah ku mu zoi, Nangni ki ril, ama hah Pathien Nâipasal ani,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua ruoisi masa ngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Anangtûka chu mahan John ha a ruoisi inik ngei lehan ânding nôka, <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Jisua lôn lâitak a mu lehan. “En ta u, Pathien Belrite soh!” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 1:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Ma ruoisi inik ngei han a thurchi misîr an rieta Jisua leh an se kelena. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Jisua ân heia, an hongjûi a mûn chu an kôm, “Khoimo nin rok?” a tipe ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:38">Anni han, “Rabbi, khonmo no om ngâi,” tiin an thuona. (Rabbi ti chu “Minchupu” tina ani).<verse eid="JHN 1:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Ama han, “Hong ungla en roi,” tiin a thuona. (ma zora ha chonûktieng dâr minli inring dôr ani.) Masuole chu an jûia a omna an mua, male mani sûna zora kai chu ama leh an mang minhek zoi.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>An lâia inkhat ha chu Andrew, Simon Peter lâibungpa ani. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>Ama han a upa Simon a mu kelena a kôm, “Messiah hah kin mu zoi,” a tia. (hi chongbâi aomtie chu “Khrista” tina ani.) <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Hanchu ama'n Simon hah Jisua kôm a tuonga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">Jisua'n Simon hah a lei ena, “Ni riming chu Simon, John nâipasal ni ni, hannirese Kephas, tiin nang koi an ti zoi,” a tia. (Ma hih Peter tina leh munkhat ania, aomtie chu “lungpui” tina ani.)<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n Philip le Nathanael a koi ngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Anangtûka chu Jisua Galileea se rangin a masata, Philip a mua, “Ni jûi roh a tipea!” <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>(Philip ha Andrew le Peter omna khopui Bethsaida mi ani.) <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Philip han Nathanael a mua a kôm, “A thurchi Moses'n Balam lekhabua a lei miziek le dêipungei khomin an miziek Joseph nâipasal Nazareth Jisua hah kin mu zoi,” tiin a rila.<verse eid="JHN 1:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Nathanael'n a kôm, “Nazareth taka neinun sa asuok thei mini?” tiin a rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:46">Philip'n a kôm, “Hongin la, en roh,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Jisua'n Nathanael a kôma hong a mua, a chungroi a misîra, “Ama hi Israel mi diktak; dikloina reng dôn loi ani!” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 1:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Nathanael'n, “Kho angin mo mi ni riet?” tiin a rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:48">Jisua'n a kôm, “Philip'n nang a koi mân theichang kung nuoia no om lâihan nang ku mu zoi,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Nathanael'n a kôm, “Minchupu,” “Pathien Nâipasal ni ni! Israelngei Rêngpa ni ni!” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 1:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Jisua'n a tia, “Theichang kung nuoia no om lâia nang ku mu kêng ani zoi nang ki ti sikin ni iem mini? Hi nêka neinun roiinpui uol ok la mûng ni tih!” a tipea. <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Male Jisua'n an kôm, “Chongtak nangni ki ril: invân ajuon onga, Miriem Nâipasal chunga vântîrtonngei an juong chum le an kal, la mûng nin tih,” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:51: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Aph 28:12</ref> </char></note> a tia.<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Cana khopuia inneina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Sûnnik suole chu Galilee ram sûnga Cana khopuia inneina aoma. Jisua nû khom mahan a oma, <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Jisua le a ruoisingei khom inneina han an siel ngei sa. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>Uain an hun khâiloi lehan, Jisua nû han a kôm, “Uain an insam zoi kêng hi,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>“Khoimo ko tho rang mi ni ril rang nâng mak,” Jisua'n, “Ko zora la tung mak.” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>Jisua nû han tîrlâmngei kôm han, “Nangni a bê murdi tho roi,” tiin a ril ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Judangei rusûk minsâi balam an dôn anghan lung tuibêl uruk mahan aoma, an sika liter razakhat keng theina chit an ni. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Jisua'n tîrlâmngei kôm, “Tuibêlngei han tui min sip roi,” a tia, anni ngei han an min sipmata, <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>male an kôm, “Atûn chu thâl ungla, moiruoipu kôm se pui roi,” tiin a ril ngeia. Ama kôm han tui ha an chôia, <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>maha uain ahong chang zoia, moiruoipu khom han a tem vika. Uain ha kho renga hong mini riet mak (aniatachu, tui thâla an mang, tîrlâmngeiin chu an rieta); masikin mâkpa hah a koia, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>male a kôm, “Mitinin uain sa an sem baka, nûk tieng khuolmingeiin an buong suo nûkin chu uain sa bâkloi an sem ngâia. Aniatachu, nangman chu atûn tena uain sa na la sem banga!” a tipea.<verse eid="JHN 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Hi sininkhêl hih Jisua'n Galilee rama Cana khopuia motontaka a sin ani; mahan a roiinpui tie ân phuonga a ruoisingeiin ama an iem zoia. <verse eid="JHN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Masuole chu, Jisua le a nû, a lâibungngei, male a ruoisingei Capernaum tieng an sea, mahan môrkhat chu an om zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:13">Mat 4:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Biekina a se</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mk 11:15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Judangei Kalkân Kût anâi zoia, masikin Jisua Jerusalema a sea.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Jôk 12:1-27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>Mahan Pathien Biekina serâtngei, kêl le belringei khom, male pharvali juorngei le sumthûlngâingei an dosângngei kôla an insung a mua. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Masikin rûiruol a jêmna rang a sina, kêl, belringei le serâtngei an reng rêngin Pathien Biekin renga a mojôk ngei heta; sumthûlngâingei an sumdârngei khom a cheknôineka, an dosângngei khom a nam melet pe ngeia, <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>male pharvali juorngei kôm han chong a pêk ngeia, “Mangei hih hi mun renga hin chôipai roi! Ka Pa in hih sadâi munin sin khâi no roi!” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>“O Pathien, ni in ranga kên pêkna hin, ku sûnga hin mei angin mi kâng ani,” tia ânziek ha a ruoisingei han an rietsuok nôk zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:9">Lap 69:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Juda rachamneipungei han chongrekel leh a kôm an hong kîr nôka, “Hima anga tho rangin racham no dôn tiin i sininkhêl thôn mo, mi ni min mu rang?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Hi Biekin hih set ungla, male sûnthumin sin minding nôk ki tih,” tiin a thuona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Mat 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:40">27:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mk 14:58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:29">15:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Hanchu Judangei han, “Hi Biekin sinna rangin kum sômminli leiruk anânga! Nangman sûnthumin ni sinminding nôk thei rang mo?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="JHN 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Aniatachu Jisua'n biekin a ti hah ama takpum ke a tina ani. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Masikin thina renga ân thoinôkin chu, a ruoisingeiin hi thurchi hih a lei misîr suozoi, ani ti an riet suoka, Pathien lekhabua chong le Jisua'n a lei ti sai ngei ha an iem zoi.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n miriem nina a rietna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Jisua Kalkân Kûta Jerusalema aom lâiin mi tamtakin a sininkhêl tho hah an mu sikin ama an iem zoia. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Hannirese Jisua'n ha mi ngei hah a riet ngei let sikin an chunga taksôn zoi maka. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>Mangei mulungrîlngeia han khoimo aom ama'n a riet var sikin tutên, mangei chungroi hah an ril rang nâng mak.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua le Nicodemus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Hanchu Phariseengei pâl kâra mi inkhat a riming Nicodemus Judangei ruoipu aoma. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>Jân khat chu Jisua kôm a sea, a kôm, “Rabbi, Pathien juongtîr Minchupu ni ni ti kin riet. Pathien an chunga aom nônchu tutên nangma angin sininkhêlngei hih tho thei no ni ngei,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Jisua'n, “Chongdiktak nang ki ril: tutu khom a suok nôk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nôk; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">chungtieng renga.</char></note> nônchu Pathien Rêngram mu thei no ni ngei,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nicodemus'n a rekela, “Kho angin mo mi ulien a chang suo nûkin a suok nôk thei rang? A nû sûnga lûtin voinik suok thei no nih!” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Jisua'n, “Chongdiktak nang ki ril ani. Tukhom tui le Ratha'n a suok nôk nônchu Pathien Rêngram lût thei no nih. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Taksân ânzir kai chu taksa mi an nia, Ratha'n ânzir kai chu ratha mi an ni. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>Nu suok nôk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nôk; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">chungtieng renga.</char></note> rang kêng ki ti hih kamâm aom ti no roh. <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Phâivuo hih anuomna ti-tieng asêma; arahang khom ni riet, aniatachu khotieng renga hong mo, khotieng mo ase rang riet mak che. Ma angdên hah ani, tukhom Ratha'n a suok nôk nônchu,” a tipea.<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Nicodemus'n, “Kho angin mo anithei ranga?” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Israelngei lâia minchupu lien ni nia, hima roi hih ni riet minthâr theiloi mini? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>Chongdiktak nang ki ril: kin ti hih kin riet ania, kin mu hih kin ril ani; hannoma, kin thurchi misîr tutên pom nuom mak chei. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Rammuola neinunngei chungroi ki misîr luo nin iem nônchu; i angin mo invân neinunngei chungroi ki misîr hin nin iem thei ranga? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Invân renga juong chumpu, Miriem Nâipasal tiloiin chu, tute invâna lei hong se sai la om mak ngei.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Chongtuon lâka mokhop ha archang 21 tena ânzompat thei.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Moses'n ramchâra sumdâr murûl a târ anghan Miriem Nâipasal khom târin a om ngêt rang ani,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:9">Tel 21:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>masika han tukhom ama iem kai chu kumtuong ringna an dôn theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Pathien'n rammuol a lungkham tatak sikin a Nâipasal khât a pêka, masika han tukhom ama iem kai chu thi loia kumtuong ringna an dôn theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Pathien'n rammuol theiloi mintum rangin a Nâipasal juongtîr maka, rammuol sanminring rangin kêng a juongtîr ani.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>Tukhom Nâipasal a iem kai chu theiloi intumin om no ni ngeia, tukhom a iem loi ngei chu atûn renga theiloi changin an om zoi, Pathien Nâikhât an iem loi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Mahi theiloi intumna chu ani: vâr ha rammuola ajuonga, aniatachu, mingeiin avâr nêkin ajîng an midit uola, an sinthongei hah asaloi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Tukhom sin saloi tho ngei nâmin chu avâr an henga, avâra hong ngâi mak ngei; asaloi an thongei hah minlang an nuom loi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Aniatachu, adik sinpu ngeiin chu Pathien chongjômna sintho an ni ti avârin a minlang theina rangin avâra an hong ngâi.<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua le John</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Masuole chu, Jisua hah a ruoisingei leh Judea ramhuola an sea, mahan môrkhat an lâia omin baptis a thoa. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>John khomin Aenon, Salim khuo kôla han mi a baptis ngâia, ma muna han tui atam sikin. Mingei a kôm an sea, male ama'n a lei baptis ngei ngâia. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>(Ma zora han John ha intângna ina la khum mak ngei.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mat 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mk 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3:19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Hanchu John ruoisi senkhatngei le Juda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:25: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Juda inkhat; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Judangei senkhat.</char></note> inkhat rusûk minsâina balam roia an inkhala. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Masikin John kôm an sea, “Minchupu, Jordan râl nisuo tienga no kôma om, a chungroi ni misîr ngâi hah na la riet mo? Asa, atûnhin, ama'n mi a baptis'a mi murdi ama tieng kêng an se suo zoi!” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>John'n a thuona, “Miriemin ite dôn mak me, Pathien'n a pêk ani nônchu. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>‘Keima hi Messiah ni mu-ung, aniatachu, a motona tîr ki ni’ ti hih nangni ngei reng hi ki rietpuipu nin ni. <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Moi puma chu mâkpa hah ani; hannirese mâkpa mal, a kôla ândinga a he a rangâichaka, a rôl a rietin chu a râisân tatak ngâi. Ma angdên han ka râisâna mikhipin aom ani. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Ama chu a hôn lal tetet ngêt rang ania, keima chu ko hôn tem tetet rang ani.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Invân renga Juongpu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>Chung tieng renga juongpu chu mi murdi nêka ânchungtak ani. Pila inzir chu pilchung mi ani, pilchung roi a misîr ngâi, hannirese, invân renga juongpu chu mi murdi nêka an chungtak ani. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>A mu le a riet ngei a misîra, hannoma, tutên a thurchi misîr pom mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Aniatachu, a thurchi misîr a pom kai chu Pathien chu mi diktak ani ti a nammindet ani. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Pathien tîrpu'n chu Pathien chong a misîr ngâi, Pathien'n ama Ratha akipin a pêk sikin. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk 10:22</ref> </char></note>Pa'n a Nâipasal a lungkham ngâia, neinunngei murdia a racham nuoia a dar let zoi. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Tukhom Nâipasal a iem kaiin chu kumtuong ringna an dôn zoi; tukhom Nâipasal chongjômloi chu ringna dôn no ni ngeia, Pathien dûkmintongna nuoia kêng an om rang.<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua le Samari nupangnu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Phariseengei han John nêkin Jisua ruoisi atam uol, ama'n tui leh mi a baptis a min tam uol ti an riet zoia. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>(Adikin, Jisua'n chu tute baptis maka; a ruoisingei vaiin ke mi an baptis ngâi ani.) <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Masikin Jisua'n ha anga an ti hah a rietin chu Judea ram a mâka Galilee tieng a kîr nôka; <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>a se tieng Samaria ram palin a se rang anâng ani.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>Samaria ram sûnga han khopui inkhat Sychar an ti han a hong tunga, Jacob'n a nâi Joseph mun a pêkna kôl hah ani. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 33:19">Aph 33:19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Jos 24:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Jacob tuikuong khom mahan aoma, Jisua'n a lam lônna a sôl sikin ha tuikuong kôla han ânsung raka, ma hah sûnchimripa ani.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Samaria nupang inkhat tuithâl rangin a honga, male Jisua'n a kôm, “Tui nêk rang mi pêk roh,” a tipea. <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>(A ruoisingei chu sâkruo rochôk rangin khopui sûnga an sea).<verse eid="JHN 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:1-5">Ezra 4:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 4:1">Neh 4:1</ref>,<ref loc="NEH 4:2">2</ref></char>
    </note> Nupangnu han a kôm, “Nangma Juda mi ni nia, keima Samaria nupang ki nia, kho-angin mo tui nêk rang mi ni zong hi?” (Judangei han khuri mo, khuriâi mo, Samaria mingeiin an mangna chu mang ngâi khâi mak ngei.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Judangei han khuringei mo, khuriâingei mo, Samaria mingeiin an mangna chu mang ngâi khâi mak ngei; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Judangei ha Samaria mingei leh ite an tho rang om mak.</char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Hanchu Jisua'n a thuona, “Pathien neinunpêk le buong rang mi pêk roh tipu hi ni riet nisenla chu, nangman keng a kôm zong na ta; hanchu, ama'n ringna-tui nang a pêk rang ani,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Nupangnu han a kôm, “Pu, tui thâlna laka ite dôn mak chea, tuikuong lak ânthûk zana. Khotieng mo ringna-tui na man rang? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Kin pu Jacob'n hi tuikuong hih mi pêka; ama le a nâingei le a sâ vâi ngei murdi khom ma renga hih an lei nêk ngâi ani. Kin pu Jacob nêkin no roiinpui uol mo?”<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Tutu khom hi tui nêk ngei chu an tui lân râl nôk a ta, <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>Hannirese, tukhom an kôma tui ke pêk rang a nêk ngei kai chu an tui inrâl nôk tet khâi no nih. Keiman tui ke pêk rang chu, an sûnga tuinâr hong chang a ta, tuinâr han ringna-tui le kumtuong ringna pêk atih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Nupangnu han a kôm, “Pu, ma tui hah ni pêk roh! ku tui ânrâl khâi loina rang le hi tena lâ tuithâl ko hong khâi loina rangin,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Jisua'n ha nu kôm han, “Sênla, no lômpa va koi inla, hong nôk roh,” a tipea.<verse eid="JHN 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Nupangnu'n a kôm, “Lômpa la dôn mu-ung,” tiin amanu han a thuona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:17">Jisua'n chong a melea, “Lômpa dôn mu-ung, ni ti hih, ni ti mindik ani. <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>Pasal rangnga in ne neipui zoia, male atûna no ompuipa khom hih no lômpa tatak nimak. Chongdiktak ni ni ril ani,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Nupangnu han a tia, “Pu, dêipu ni ni ti ki riet.” <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>“Kin Samari richibulngeiin chu hi tânga hin Pathien chubai an mûk ngâi, aniatachu, nangni Judangeiin chu Jerusalema Pathien chubai kin mûk ngâi ani, nin ti ngâi.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Jisua'n, nupangnu kôm han a tipea, “Nupangnu, keima mi iem roh, hi tâng le Jerusalem ngêt ni loi khomin mingeiin Pa chubai an mûk zora la tung atih. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Nangni Samari mingeiin chu nin riet loi chubai nin mûk ngâi; aniatachu keini Judangeiin chu kin riet ke chubai kin mûk ngâi ani, sanminringna hih Judangei renga hong suok kêng ani sikin. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Hannirese azora atung rang ani zoi, male atûn khom atung tir ani zoi, ma tikin chu Pathien chubaimûk ngeiin Ratha le Chongtakin Pa chubaimûk an tih, Pa'n ma anga mingei ha ama chubaimûk rangin a nuom ngâi ani. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Pathien chu Ratha ania, ama chubai mûk ngeiin Ratha le chongtakin chubai an mûk rang ani,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Nupangnu han a kôm, “Messiah la juong atih, ti ki riet, a juong tikin chu neinunngei murdi mi ril atih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Keima nang chongpuipa hih, ama hah ki ni,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Ma lâitak han a ruoisingei an hong kîr nôka, nupang leh an chong an mua an kamâm sabaka. Aniatachu, tutên ha nu kôm han, “Imo no zong?” aninônchu ama kôm, “Ithomo nupang no chongpuia?” tiin khom ite rekel mak ngei.<verse eid="JHN 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Hanchu nupangnu hah a tuibêl mâkrakin khopui sûnga a kîra, male mingei kôm, <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>“Ki sin lei tho ngei murdi a ril thei let mi inkhat a oma, hong en ta u, Messiah ni thei ni mo?” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Masikin khopui renga an honga Jisua kôm an va se zoi.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Ma zoratak han ruoisingeiin, “Minchupu, sâk-sâk bak hi roh!” tiin an lei ngêna.<verse eid="JHN 4:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Nikhomsenla Jisua'n, “Nin riet loi bu nêk rang ko dôn,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 4:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Masikin ruoisingei han anni leh anni anin rekela, “Mîn bu an hong chôi pe mini?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Mi tîrpu lungdo sin le a sin zoi rang hi ku bu tuitak ani, a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Nangnin chu, ‘Bu âtna rang tha minli ala om nin tia.’ Aniatachu nangni ki ril, loingei so en sabak ta u; atûn renga ât rangin bungei an min zoi! <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>A âtpu'n chu rathaman a man ngâia, kumtuong ringna dêna om rangin amara a mintûp ngâi; masikin a lingpu le a âtpu an râisân ânruol theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>‘Mi inkhatin a linga, mi dangin a ât ngâi,’ ti hi adik ani. <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>Nin sin loina muna nangni ki tîr; mi dangin an sina, an sin sai hah nin ât ani,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Nupangnu han, “Ki sin lei tho ngei murdi ni ril let,” tiin a thurchi a misîr pe ngei sikin Samari khopui mingei, mi tamtakin Jisua an iem zoi. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Masikin, Samari mingei ha Jisua kôm an honga, an kôm om rangin an ngêna, male Jisua'n ha khopui han sûnnik a châm zoi.<verse eid="JHN 4:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Midang tamtakin khom a thurchi misîr sikin an iem sa zoia, <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>male anni ngei han nupangnu kôm, “Atûn chu mi ni misîr pe sika ni loiin keini lelên a thurchi misîr kin rieta, hi mi hih rammuol sanminringpu ani khet ti kin riet zoi,” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n sorkâr ulien nâipasal a mindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Ma khopui han sûnnik a châm suole chu a mâka Galilee rama a se zoi. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>Jisua'n ama rang nanâk ân tia, “Dêipungei chu an ram nanâka chu miritin om ngâi mak ngei,” tiin. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:44: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mat 13:57</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:4">Mk 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luk 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Galilee rama a tungin chu mipuingeiin an lei phâm tataka, Jerusalema Kalkân Kût han inchelin Jisua sintho ngei murdi ha an mu sikin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:23">Joh 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Hanchu, Jisua ha Galilee rama Cana khuoa tui uain a min changna han a hong nôka, sorkâr ulien inkhat a oma, a nâipasal Capernaum khuoa dam loiin a om ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:46: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:1-11">Joh 2:1-11</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Jisua Judea ram renga Galilee rama a hong ti a riet lehan a kôm a sea, Capernaum khuoa sea, a nâipasal juong mindam rangin Jisua a ngêna, a nâipasal hah a thi vang zoi ani. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Sininkhêlngei le neinun kamâmomngei nin mu nônchu tutên iem no tu nui,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 4:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Sorkâr ulien han, “Pu, ka nâipasal a thi mân ni juong pe roh,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 4:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Se nôk ta roh, na nâipasal a dam zoi!” a tipea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:50">Ha mi han Jisua chongngei ha iem pumin a se zoi. <verse eid="JHN 4:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>Hanchu a in a pan lâiin lampuia a tîrlâmngei leh annin tonga, “Na nâipasal a dam zoi!” an tipea.<verse eid="JHN 4:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Ama'n an kôm, a nâipasal lei dam zora tak hah a rekel ngeia, annin a kôm, “Mazan chonûktieng dârkhat inring han a mintun a lei mathân zoi,” an tipea. <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>Hanchu, a pa han Jisua'n a kôm, “Na nâipasal a dam zoi,” a tipe zora tak hah ani ti a riet zoi. Masikin ama le a inmingei anrêngin an iem zoi ani.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Ma hah Jisua'n Judea ram renga Galilee rama a hong suo nûka a sininkhêl sin avoinikna ani.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n dîla mi a mindamna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Masuole chu, Jisua Jerusalema Judah sakhuo tienga khohoi aom sikin a sea. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Jerusalem Belri Mokot kôla han dîl<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Belri mokot kôla dîl inkhat; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Belri dîl kôla mun inkhata.</char></note> inkhat aoma, Hebrew chongin Bethzatha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bethzatha; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bethesda.</char></note> an ti ngâi; ma dîl han bokrop rangnga aoma. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3"/>Ma bokropngei han damloi ngei loko tamtak an jâla mitcho ngei, kholra ngei le phalkhatthi ngei, tui singânsa zora an ngâka, <verse eid="JHN 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4"/>a kakâra dîl han vântîrton, a juonga, tui ha a juong chek ngâi. Ma tui singânsa zora han dîla a lût masatak chu i-anga natna khomnirese an dam ngêt ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Mi inkhat kum sômthum leiriet damloi a oma. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Jisua'n a jâlin ava mua, male zora sôt tak renga damloia om ani ti a rieta; masikin a kôm, “Dam rang no jôt mo?” tiin a rekela.<verse eid="JHN 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>Hanchu damloipu han, “Pu, tui singânsa zora dîla mi juong thak rang lak dôn mu-ung; ke se khomin mîn, min khêl nôk ngâi,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Inthoi inla, na jâmpher louk inla, lôn ta roh,” a tipea. <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>Ha mi han voikhatrengin a hong dam kelena; a jâmpher chôiin a lôn phut kelen zoi. Ma nikhuo hah sabbathni ania, <verse eid="JHN 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>masikin Juda rachamneipungeiin a dampu kôm han, “Avien hin sabbathni kêng ani, jâmpher chôia lôn hi ei balam nimak,” <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:19">Neh 13:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 17:21">Jer 17:21</ref></char></note> an tipea.<verse eid="JHN 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>Ama han an kôm, “Ni mindampu'n, ‘Na jâmpher louk inla, lôn ta roh’ mi ti kêng,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Anni ngei han, “Hi anga tho ranga nang rilpu hah tumo ani?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="JHN 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Hannirese, ha a dampu han Jisua hah tumo ani riet mak, ha muna han mipui an tam sikin Jisua chu a rotpat zoi.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Chomol suole chu, Jisua'n ama hah Biekina a mua male a kôm, “Rangâi roh, na dam zoi ani; masikin nunsie tho nôk khâi no roh, nu chunga natna saloi uol hong tung nih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Masuole chu ha mi han Juda rachamneipungei kôm a mindampu chu Jisua ani ti ava ril ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Masikin sabbathni mi a mindam an ti sikin Jisua hah dûk an mintong zoi. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Ka Pa'n sin a tho tit ngâia, male kei khom sin ko tho ngêt rang ani,” tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Ma anghan a ti sikin Juda rachamneipungeiin that rang an bôk uol nôk zoi; Sabbathni balam a siet ti vai niloiin, Pathien hah a Pa angin a bêa, ama khom Pathien leh ân-angin ânbê ti sika khom ani.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nâipasal rachamneina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Masikin Jisua'n a thuon ngeia, “Chongdik tak nangni ki ril: Nâipasal athenin ite tho thei maka; a Pa sintho a mu ngei kai vai ke a tho ngâi. Pa'n sin a tho kai ke Nâipasal khomin a tho ngâi ani. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Pa'n Nâipasal a lungkhama male a tho murdi a min mu ngâi ani. Hi nêka neinun roiinpui a tho rang khom la min mûng atih, male nin rêngin nin la kamâm rang ani. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Pa'n mithi a kaithoia ringna a pêk ngei anghan, Nâipasal khomin a nuom kai chu a min ring ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Pa'n tute roijêk pe ngâi maka. Roijêk rangin Nâipasal kôm kêng rachamneina akipin a pêk zoia, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>masikin mi murdi'n Pa mirit an tho anghan Nâipasal khom mirit an tho theina rangin. Tukhom Nâipasal mirit tho loi kai chu Pa a tîrpu mirit tho loi ani.<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>“Chongdik tak nangni ki ril: Tukhom ko chong rieta mi tîrpu iem kaiin chu kumtuong ringna an dôn zoi. Theiloi changin om mak ngeia, thina renga an jôka ringna han an lût zoi ani. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>Chongdik tak nangni ki ril: azora atung rang ani zoi, atûn khom atung tir zoi, male mithi ngeiin Pathien Nâipasal rôl riet an ta, a riet ngei kai chu hong ring an tih. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Pa ha ringna nâr ani anghan, Nâipasal khom ringna nârin a sin ani. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>Male Miriem Nâipasal ani sikin a kôm roijêk rangin rachamneina a pêk ani. <verse eid="JHN 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>Ma hi kamâm no roi; azora atung rang ani zoi, ma tikin chu mithi ngeiin a rôl riet an ta, <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>male an thânngei renga hôn thoi an ta: sin sa tho ngei chu ringna changin inthoi nôk an ta, sin saloi tho ngei chu theiloi changin inthoi nôk an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Dan 12:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua rietpuipungei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>“Ke thena rachamneinân ite tho thei mu unga; Pathien'n ni ril lam anghan roi ke jêk ani, masikin ko roijêk chu adik ani. Keima ku nuom hi sin rangin bôk mu unga, mi tîrpu lungdo kêng sin rang ko bôk ani.<verse eid="JHN 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>“Ku thurchi nanâk misîr ronga, ku thurchi misîr ha adik tiin pom thei ni no ni. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Aniatachu ku thurchi mi aminrietpu chu mi dang ania, male ama'n ku thurchi a misîr hah adik ti ki riet. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Nangnin John kôm thangtheipungei nin tîra, ama han chongtak ruthûlin chong nangni a lei rila.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:19-27">Joh 1:19-27</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:27-30">3:27-30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>Munisi rietpuipu ko dôn ngêt rang ki ti nimaka; mahi sanminringa nin om theina ranga ki ti ani. <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>John hah châti vârtak le ân-ângtak angin ani, male zora bongkit vai mang rang nin nuom ani anghan. <verse eid="JHN 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>Hannirese, rietpuipu ko dôn hi chu John minrietna chong nêkin a roiinpui uol: Khoimo ko tho, ma hah, Pa'n sintho ranga mi pêk ani, ki sintho ngêt hin Pa mi tîr ani ti ku thurchi a minriet ani. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>Male Pa mi tîrpu khom han a minriet zoi, nangnin chu khotik lâi khomin a rôl la riet ngâi mak chei, a mêl khom la mu mak chei,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mk 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>male a chong khom nin mulungrîlngeia vong ngâi mak chei, a tîrpu hi nin iem loi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Asûnga kumtuong ringna aom ti nin sabei sikin, Pathien Lekhabungei ha nin pore ngâi. Male Pathien Lekhabungei han ku thurchi an misîr ani! <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>Hankhoma, ringna nin dôna rangin ko kôm hong jôt ngâi mak chei.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>“Munisi minpâkna rok mu-ung. <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>Aniatachu kho anga miriem mo nin ni nangni ki riet, male nin mulungrîlngei han Pathien lungkhamna dôn mak chei ti ki riet. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>Ka pa rachamneina leh ku juong ani, hannirese mi modôm mak choia; nikhomrese, tumakhatin ama rachamin hong rese chu lei modôm nin tih. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Pathien inkhat vai renga minpâkna man rang nuom mak choia, inkhat le inkhat inpâk inlôm kêng nin min luta; nônte, kho angin mo mi nin iem rang? <verse eid="JHN 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>Nikhomrese, keiman Pa makunga nangni doi ki tih tiin mindon no roi. Nangni doi rang chu mi inkhat aom, nin sabeipu Moses ha. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Moses nin iem tatakin chu, kei khom mi nin iem rang ani; ama han ku chungroi kêng a miziek sikin. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Aniatachu a miziek nin iem nônchu, kho angin mo ko chong nin iem thei ranga?” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n mi isâng rangnga a vâina roi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Masuole chu, Jisua Galilee dîl râl inkânin a se zoi. (Tiberias dîl khom an ti sa ngâi). <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Damloi ngei chunga a sininkhêlngei an mu sikin loko tamtakin an jûia. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Jisua hah muola a kala male a ruoisingei leh an insunga. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Judangei Kalkân kût zora ha anâi zoia. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Jisua'n akôl akieng a hong ena, loko tamtakin ama tieng an hong pan a mua, masikin Philip kôm han, “Hi mingei sâk rang vâipôl khonmo ei rochôk rang?” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>(Hi chong hi Philip minsina ranga a ti ani, adiktakin chu imo a tho rang lam ama'n a riet sai ani.)<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Philip'n a kôm, “Mitinin achîn tete min chang ngei rang khomin sumdâr duli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">sumdâr duli ngei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sumdâr duli chu tângrama chuonsinpu sûnkhat rathaman ani (Mat 20:2 en roh.)</char></note> razannik man vâipôlin luo hun no ni ngei,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>A ruoisingei adang inkhat, Simon Peter lâibungpa Andrew'n a tia, <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>“Barli vâipôl pêk rangnga le nga inik a dôn pasalte inkhat hi hin aom. Aniatachu hi dôra mingei sâk rangin chu hun no ni ngei,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Jisua'n, “Mipuingei hah minsung roi,” tiin a ril ngeia. (Ma mun han durba tamtak aom.) Mipuingei ha an insung zoia; mi isâng rangnga dôr an ni. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Jisua'n vâipôl hah a lâka, Pathien kôm râisânchong a rila, male mipui ânsungngei hah a sem pe ngeia; ma angdên han nga khom a sem nôka, an nuom do-dôr a sem pe ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>An khoptang suo nûkin a ruoisingei kôm, “Ite inpai riek loi rangin an sâk minieng; khom rûtvar roi,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Masikin barli vâipôl rangnga sâk ngei, an sâk minieng ha tabong sômleinik an la rût min sipa.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Ha mingei han Jisua sininkhêl sin hah an mûn chu, “Hi mi hih dêipu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dêipu ha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1:21 en roh.</char></note> tatak, rammuola juong rangpu ha ani khet!” an tia. <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Anni ngei hah hongin, ama hah rangrâta sûrin rêng minchang rang an bôk ti Jisua'n a rieta; masikin athenin muola a se nôk zoi.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua tui chunga a lôn</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mk 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Kholoi ahong nin chu, Jisua ruoisingei hah dîla an juong sea, <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>rukuonga an chuonga, dîl râl Capernaum tieng an pana. Jân ahong ni tena khom Jisua hah an kôm la hong tung maka. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Hanchu phâivopui hong rângin ahong sêma male tuidâr ahôn soka. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Hanchu ruoisingei han kilometer rangnga mini, uruk mini an hong jâpin chu Jisua hah tui chunga lônin rukuong tieng a hong panin an mua, an lei chia. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Chi no roi, keima kêng ki ni!” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Hanchu râisântakin rukuonga han an min chuonga, male rukuong leh an va pana, tângkôl hah harenghan an tung kelen zoi.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mingeiin Jisua an rok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Anangtûka chu dîl râl kângkhat tienga mipui a omngei han rukuong inkhat vai mahan aom ti an rieta. Jisua chu a ruoisingei leh rukuonga chuong loiin, anni ngei ha mâkin anthenin an se ti an riet zoia. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Pumapa'n râisânchong a ril suole lokongeiin vâipôl an sâkna mun kôla han rukuong dang ngei Tiberias renga an hong tunga. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Mipuingeiin Jisua le a ruoisingei chu ha muna han om khâi mak ngei ti an rietin chu anni khom rukuonga chuongin Capernauma, Jisua rok rangin an se zoi.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua ringna vâipôl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Mipuingei han Jisua dîl râla an hong mûn chu a kôm, “Minchupu, khotik han mo hi tieng râl no hong tung?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Chongdiktak nangni ki ril: sininkhêlngei nin riet sika mi nin rok ni loiin, vâipôl nin sâk man sika mi nin rok kêng, tiin a thuona. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Vâipôl asiet nôk thei ngâi rangin sin no ungla; manêkin chu kumtuong ringna vâipôl adier rangin sin roi. Hi vâipôl hih Miriem Nâipasalin nangni a pêk rang ani, Pathien, Pa, han ama sînthona a chunga adar zoi sikin.”<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Masikin anni ngei han a kôm, “Pathien lungdo kin sin theina rangin imo kin tho rang?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="JHN 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Jisua'n a thuon ngeia, “Pathien'n khoimo sin ranga nangni a nuom chu a tîrpu iem hih ani,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Anni ngei han a kôm, “I sininkhêl mo ni sin rang, kin mua nang kin iem theina rangin? Imo no tho rang? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Kin richibulngei chu ramchâra han manna an sâk ngâia, Pathien lekhabu'n ati anghan, ‘Invân renga vâipôl sâk rang a pêk ngei,’” tiin chong an thuona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:4">Jôk 16:4</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 16:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:24">Lap 78:24</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Chongdiktak nangni ki ril,” “Moses'n vâipôl nangni a pêk hah invân renga nimaka;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:32: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Moses'n nangni pêk hah nimaka; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nangni pêkpu ha Moses nimak.</char></note> Ka Pa'n kêng invân renga vâipôl diktak nangni a pêk. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Pathien'n vâipôl nangni a pêk chu invân renga a juong chuma rammuol ranga a ringna pêkpu hih ani.”<verse eid="JHN 6:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Anni ngeiin, “Pu, ma vâipôl hah mi pêk bang roh,” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 6:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Keima hih ringna vâipôl ki ni.” “Tukhom ko kôma hong ngei chu an vonchâm no nia; tukhom keima mi iem ngei chu an tui inrâl khâi no ni. <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Atûn hin, nangni ki ril, mi nin mua aniatachu mi iem mak chei. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>Pa'n mi pêk ngei kai chu ko kôm hong an tih. Ko kôma hong kai chu tute rujûl tet noning, <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>ku lungdo sin ranga invân renga juong ni mu unga, mi tîrpu lungdo sin ranga juong kêng ki ni. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Ma hih mi tîrpu lungdo chu ani, mi pêk ngei murdi tute minmang loiin nikhuo nûktaka chu aringin kaithoi inlang, ti hih. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>Ka Pa'n a nuom tak chu tukhom Nâipasal mua a iem ngei murdi'n chu kumtuong ringna dôn senla ngei, keiman nikhuo nûktaka, mangei hah kaithoi ngei inlang ti hi ani,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>“Invân renga vâipôl juong chum ki ni,” a ti sikin mipuingei hah an chierlul zoi.<verse eid="JHN 6:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Masikin anni ngei han, “Hi mi hih Joseph nâipasal Jisua hah nimak mo? A nû le a pa khom ei rieta. Nônte, kho angin mo, invân renga juong chum ki ni a ti thei hi?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 6:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Nin thenin chier kekêng no roi. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>Pa mi tîrpu'n a kaikuoi nônchu tute ko kôm hong thei no ni ngei; male keiman nikhuo nûktaka chu kaithoi ngei ki tih. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Dêipungei lekhabua, ‘Pathien'n mitin la minchu ngei atih,’ tiin an miziek ani. Mitin Pa chong rieta ânchu ngei kai chu ko kôm an hong ngâi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 54:13">Isa 54:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Mahi tutên Pa an mu zoi ki tina nimaka; Pa kôm renga juongpu vaiin kêng Pa ha a mu ani. <verse eid="JHN 6:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>Chongdiktak nangni ki ril: tukhom a iem kai chu kumtuong ringna an dôn zoi. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>Keima hih ringna vâipôl ki ni. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Nin richibulngeiin ramchâra manna hah an sâka chu an thi dên ani. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Aniatachu, invân renga vâipôl juong chum hi chu tukhomin an sâka anîn chu thi khâi no ni ngei. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Keima hi vâipôl aring invân renga juong chum ki ni. Tukhomin hi vâipôl hih a sâkin chu kumtuongin ring tit atih. Vâipôl ke pêk rang chu ka taksa hi ani, rammuol ringna ranga ke pêk chu” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Masikin Judangei ha taksîn an inkhal phut zoia. “Kho angin mo hi miriempa hin a taksa ei sâk rangin mi pêk thei ranga?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="JHN 6:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Chongdiktak nangni ki ril: Miriem Nâipasal taksa hih nin sâk noa, a thisen khom nin buong nônchu nin thethenin ring thei no tunui. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Tukhom ka taksa a sâka, ki thisen a buong kai chu kumtuong ringna an dôn zoi, male anni ngei ha keiman nikhuo nûktaka kaithoi ngei ki tih. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>Ka taksa hi bu diktak a nia; ki thisen hi buong ruo tak ani. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Tukhom ka taksa sâka, ki thisen buong ngei kai chu keima ko kôm an om banga, male kei khom an kôm ko om bang ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>Pa aring han mi tîra, male Pa jâra ring ki ni sa. Ma angdên han ka taksa sâk ngei kai chu keima jârin ring an tih. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Ma hih invân renga vâipôl juong chum chu ani; nin pilepungeiin vâipôl an sâka an thi nôk angha nimak. Tukhom hi vâipôl sâk ngei kai chu kumtuongin ringtit an ti.”<verse eid="JHN 6:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Hi chong hih Jisua'n Capernaum synagog taka a minchu lâia a ti ani.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumtuong ringna chongngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>A nûkjûi tamtak ngeiin hi chong hih an rietin chu, “Hi minchuna hih chong ngartak kêng ani. Tumo a rangâi thei ranga?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Tutên ril loiin, a ruoisingei hah ma roia han an chier ani, ti Jisua'n a mulungrîlin a rieta, an kôm, “Hi roi sika hin nin mulung amin hoiloi mini? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>Nônte, chongkhatin, Miriem Nâipasal hih motona a omna ngâia a kîr nôk nin mu tika kho angin mo nin tho rang? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Ringna pêkpu chu Pathien Ratha ania; munisi ranak chu ite a mangna omak. Nin kôma ki misîr chongngei hih ringna pêkpu Pathien Ratha ani. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Hannoma senkhat chu iem mak chei,” a tia. (Jisua'n aphut renga tu ngei mo a iem loi rang le tu lelên mo a minsûr rang a riet chien sai ani.) <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Male a bôksa nôka, “Hi sika hin kêng, Pa'n a thop nônchu tute ko kôm hong thei no ni ngei ki ti ani.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Masika han Jisua nûkjûi ngei mi tamtakin nûkkîr an thoa, ama jûi khâi mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Masikin Jisua'n ruoisi sômleinik ngei kôm, “Nangni khom rot rang nin jôt mo?” tiin a rekel ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 6:67"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simon Peter'n a kôm, “Pumapa, tu kôm mo kin rot ranga? Kumtuong ringna chongngei laka nangman no dôna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:68,69: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16">Mat 16:16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:29">Mk 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:20">Luk 9:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>Male atûn chu kin iema, Pathien renga juong Mi Inthieng ni ni ti kin riet zoi,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 6:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Nangni sômleinik ngei hih keiman nangni ka thang nimak mo? Hannoma nin lâia mi inkhat hih diabol kêng ani!” tiin chong a mele. <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Ama han Judas, Simon Iscariot nâipasal chungroi a misîr ani. Judas hah ruoisi sômleinik ngei lâia mi nikhomsenla, ama a minsûr rang ani sikin.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua le a lâibungngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Masuole chu, Jisua'n Galilee rama a chaia; Juda rachamneipungeiin that rang an bôk sikin Judea rama chu chai nuom khâi mak. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Judangei Kâirêng khohoi zora anâi zoia,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Och 23:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:13">Bal 16:13</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>masikin Jisua lâibungngei han a kôm, “Hi mun hih mâk inla, Judea rama se roh, masika han nu nûkjûi ngeiin ni sintho an mu theina rangin, an tia. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Ama riming inthang rang nuompu chu tutên a sintho thup ngâi mak. Hi neinunngei hih ni sin anînchu rammuol pumpuiin nu chungroi riet rese bah!” an tia. <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>(A lâibungngei luon ama iem mak ngei.)<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Keima rangin chu azora diktak la tung mak. Zora pai hih nangni rangin chu adik ani. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Rammuolin nangni mumâk maka, aniatachu keima chu mi mumâk ngâi, a sintho ngei ha sa mak tiin ki ril ngâi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Khohoia nangni lei se roi, kei chu khohoia la se<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:8: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kei chu se no ning; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kei chu la se no ning.</char></note> thei no ning, ko zora diktak ala tung loi sikin,” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Ma chong hah a ti suole khom ama chu Galilee rama a la om bang.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Kâirêng Khohoia ân chel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>A lâibungngei khohoia an se suole chu Jisua khom a se sa; ânlangin chu se maka, inrûkin a se zoi. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Juda rachamneipungeiin khohoia han ama an roka, “Khonmo aom?” tiin an rekel titira.<verse eid="JHN 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Mipuingeiin a chungroia an inkereng chichiena; senkhatin, “Miriem sa kêng,” an tia. Adang ngeiin, “Nimak, ama kêng mingei lamnôk tieng a tuong ngâi,” an tia. <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Hannirese Juda rachamneipungei an chi sikin tutên ânlangin chu a chungroi misîr ngam mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Khohoi ha inang dôr an mang tena chu Jisua Biekina a sea mingei a minchu phut zoi. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Juda rachamneipungei han an kamâm sabaka, “Hi mi hi ânchuna boi tetin kho angin mo madôr a riet thei hi!” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Ki minchuna chong hih keima kata nimaka, aniatachu Pathien mi tîrpu renga juong kêng ani. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Tutu khom Pathien lungdo a sin nuom kai chu hi minchuna chong hih Pathien renga juong mo, aninônchu ka rachama ko chong mo riet an tih. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Tukhom ama rachama chongpu chu ama roiinpuina man rang a pût ani. Hannirese, a tîrpu roiminpui rang a nuompu'n chu dikna a dôna, male ama sûnga han dikloina reng omak. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Moses'n Balam nangni a pêk nimak mo? Hannirese Balam hah tutên jôm mak chei. Ithomo ni that rang nin bôk hi?” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Mipuingei han, “Ramkhori nang a sûr ngihi! Tumo nang that rang a bôk?” tiin lokongeiin an thuona.<verse eid="JHN 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Sininkhêl inkhat ko thoa, nin rêngin nin kamâm sabaka. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Moses'n nin nâipasalngei sertan rangin chong nangni a pêka (Moses'n a phut nimaka, nin richibulngeiin kêng an phut ani), masikin Sabbathnin pasalte ser nin tan ngâi ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:3">Och 12:3</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:10">Aph 17:10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Moses Balam asiet loina rangin Sabbathni khom pasalte sertan nin tho ngâi anînte, keiman Sabbathnia mi ki mindam phar sikin ithomo ku chunga nin takasi?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:9">Joh 5:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Pêntienga ânlang rang vaiin roijêk mong ungla, male adiktakin roijêk roi,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ama hih Messiah ani mo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Jerusalema mi senkhatin an tia, “Hi mi hih rachamneipungeiin that ranga an pût ha nimak mo? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>En ta u! Mipui rietin thurchi a misîra, male tutên rokôk mak ngei! Ama hih Messiah ani tiin rachamneipu ngeiin an riet tatak zoi mini? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Aniatachu Messiah a juong tika chu kho renga mo a juong tutên riet no ni ngei. Hi mi hi chu a hongna ei rêngin ei riet-iem ani,” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Jisua'n Biekina a minchu lâihan rôl inringtakin a tia, “Tumo ki ni le kho renga hong mo ki ni nin riet tatak mo zoi? Ka rachama juong ni mu-ung. Mi tîrpu chu mi diktak ani. Nangnin chu ama ha riet mak choia, <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>aniatachu keiman chu ama ha ki rieta, a kôm renga juong le ama mi tîr ki ni sikin,” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Hanchu ama hah sûr rang an pût zoia, aniatachu, azora ala tung loi sikin tutên an kut musum mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Hannirese mipui lâia mi tamtakin chu ama an iem zoi, “Messiah a juong tika hi mi hin a sin nêka tam sininkhêlngei sin thei ni mo?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua sûr rangin rungpungei an tîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Phariseengeiin Jisua chungroia mipuingei an inkereng chichiena chong an rieta, masikin ochaisingei le Phariseengeiin Jisua sûr rangin rungpungei an tîra. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Chomolte nin kôm la om ka ta, masuole chu mi tîrpu kôm sêng ki tih, a tia. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>Nangnin mi rok nin ta, mi mu no tunui, ke sena ranga nin se thei loi sikin.”<verse eid="JHN 7:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Juda rachamneipungei han anni nanâkin, “Ei mu thei loina rangin khotieng mo se rang a ti? Ei mingei omna Greek khopuilienngeia sea, male Greekngei juong minchu rang a ti mini? an tia. <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>Nangnin mi rok nin ta mi mu no tunui, ke sena ranga hong thei no tunui, a ti hih khoimo a tina?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ringna-pêk tuidungngei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:36">Och 23:36</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Khohoi chîn rang ni le nikhuo lupuitak ni han Jisua ândinga, rôl inringtakin, “Tukhom a tui ânrâl kai chu ko kôm hong senla ngeia, nêk rese ngei, male <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 47:1">Ezek 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:8">Zak 14:8</ref></char></note>Pathien lekhabu'n ati anghan, tukhom mi iem kai chu a sûng renga ‘Ringna-pêk’ tuinârngei luong suok atih,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:38: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Archang 37-38 taka Jisua chongbâingei hi ma anghin melet thei ani: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">“Tukhom a tui inrâl ngei chu ko kôm hong senla ngeia male nêk rese ngei. </char><char style="fv">38</char> <char style="fq" closed="false">Pathien lekhabu'n ati anghan, tukhom, mi iem kai chu an sûng renga ‘Ringna-pêk tuinârngei luong suok atih.’”</char></note> a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Mahi Jisua'n ama iem ngeiin Ratha an chang rang chungroi a misîrna ani. Ma zora han Ratha pêk la nimaka; Jisua ha roiinpuia kaithoi ala ni loi sikin.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mingei lâia insenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Mingei lâia senkhatin ha chong hah an rietin chu, “Hi mi hih Dêipu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:40: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Dêipu ha: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1:21 en roh.</char></note> tatak kêng ani ngihi!” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 7:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Adangngeiin chu, “Ama hih Messiah kêng ani!” an tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:41">Hannirese adangngeiin chu, “Messiah chu Galilee ram renga hong suok no nih! an tia. <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Pathien lekhabu'n ati anghan Messiah chu Rêng David jâisuon renga nîng a ta, David omna khopui Bethlehema a suok rang ani,” an tia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2 Sam 7:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mic 5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Masikin Jisua sikin mipuingei lâia insenna aom zoia. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Mi senkhatin sûr rang an bôka, aniatachu tutên a chunga an kut musum mak ngei.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Juda Rachamneipungei iemloina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Mi rungpungei ha an hong kîr nôka, Ochaisingei le Phariseengei han an kôm, “Ithomo nin hong tuong loi?” tiin an rekel ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 7:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Mi rungpungei han an thuona, “Hipa anga thurchi misîr reng la om ngâi mak ngei!” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="JHN 7:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Phariseengeiin an kôm, “Nangni khom huongin nin om sa mo ni zoi?” tiin an rekel ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>“Rachamneipungei le Phariseengei lâia mi inkhat luon ama an iem zoi ti nin riet mo? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Hi mipuingei hih Moses Balam riet mak ngei, masikin Pathien khomâksâmna nuoia om kêng an ni!”<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Phariseengei lâia mi inkhat Nicodemus, motona Jisua intongpui ranga sêpu ha a oma. Ama'n midangngei kôm,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 3:1">Jon 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JON 3:2">2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>“Ei Balam dungjûiin chu tukhom a chongbâi suok ei riet mân le a sintho ei mu mân chu theiloi minchang thei ngâi mak me,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 7:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>“Asa,” anni ngei han a kôm, “Nang khom Galilee ram renga hong mo ni ni? Pathien Lekhabungei pore inla dêipu Galilee ram renga hong<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:52: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dêipu reng hong suok ngâi mak; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ti hi miziek inkhatin a dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dêipu reng hong suok no ni.</char></note> suok ngâi mak ti riet ni tih,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="JHN 7:52"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="s">Nupang inrê an sûr</para>
  <para style="p">[<verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Hanchu mitinin an ina an sea, aniatachu, Jisua chu Olive tânga a sea. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Anangtûk jînga ânmânin Biekina a se nôka. Mipuingei murdi a kôm an hôn tûpa; ânsunga anni ngei ha a minchu ngei phut zoia. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Balam minchupungei le Phariseengei han nupangnu ânrê lâitaka an sûrnu hah an hong tuonga, male an rênga an moton han amanu hah an mindinga. <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>Jisua kôm, “Minchupu, hi nupangnu hih ânrê lâitaka kin sûr ani. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Ei Balamin Moses chongpêk angin chu hi nupangu hih lung leh dêng that ngêt rang ani. Atûn hin, nangman kho angin mo ni ti?” an tia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 20:10">Och 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 22:22-24">Bal 22:22-24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Ma hah ama min ôkna ranga an ti ani, demna an man theina rangin. Aniatachu Jisua ân kûna, a kutruol leh pil a mizieka. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Ma anga indingin chong an rekel anghan ânthoi lita, male an kôm, “Nin lâia nunsie tho loitakin motontaka lung leh amanu hah dêng bak roi,” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Hanchu ân kûn nôka, a kutruol leh pil a miziek nôka. <verse eid="JHN 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>A chong hah an rietin chu, a ulien dônin inkhat inkhatin, an rot riei zoia. Jisua hah athenin an mâk raka, nupangnu hah ma muna a lân ding chien lehan. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Jisua hah a hôn dinga, nupangnu kôm han, “Khonmo an om suo zoi? Tutên theiloi nang mintum rang om khâi mak ngei na?” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Amanu han a thuona, “Pu, tutên theiloi mi mintum mak ngei,” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:11">Jisua'n a kôm, “Asa, nônchu, kei khom theiloi nang mintum uol mu-ung. Se roh, hannirese nunsie tho nôk khâi no roh,”] <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek tamtak ngei le tiena chongmeletngei chu hi archang (8:1-11) hih dôn mak ngei; adangngeiin Jon 21:24 suole an dôna; maha adangngeiin Luk 21:38 suole an dôna; miziek inkhatin chu Jon 7:36 suole maha a dôn ani.</char></note> a tia.<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua rammuol vâr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Jisua'n Phariseengei kôm a chong nôka. “Keima hi rammuol vâr ki ni,” a tia. “Tukhom mi jûi murdi chu ringna vâr dôn an ta, ijînga lôn tet no ni ngei.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Phariseengeiin a kôm, “Atûn hin nu thurchi nanâk kêng ni misîr; nu thurchi misîr dik mak,” an tia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:31">Joh 5:31</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>“Nimak,” Jisua'n an kôm, “Ku thurchi nanâk misîr khom ronga, ki misîr hih adik kêng. Keima chu kho renga mo ku juong le kho tieng mo ke se rang khom ki riet. Nangni chu kho renga mo ku juong aninônchu, kho tieng mo ke se rang riet mak chei. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Nangnin chu taksa balam angtakin roi nin tan ngâia; keiman chu tu roi te tan ngâi mu-ung. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Ke lei tanna khom om senla, ko roi tanna chu dik atih; asikchu ke theivaia om ni mu unga; Pa mi tîrpu ko kôm a om sikin. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>Nin Balam lekhabua khom rietpuipu inik an inruola, imo an ti tak chu adik, tiin miziekin aom ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Bal 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>Keiman ku thurchi nanâk ki misîra, male Pa mi tîrpu khomin ku thurchi a misîr sa ngâi,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Anni ngei han, “Khomo na Pa?” tiin ama an rekela.,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:19">“Nangnin mi riet mak choia, ka Pa khom riet uol mak chei. Mi nin riet nisenla chu ka Pa khom riet nin ti zoi,” tiin Jisua'n a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Jisua'n hi ngei murdi hih Biekina chôiruol dôngna an darna mun khâltan sûnga a minchu lâia a ti ani. Tutên ama hah sûr mak ngei azora ala tung loi sikin.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ke sena ranga se thei no tunui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Ke sepat rang kêng ani zoi; nangnin mi rok nin ta chu, nin sietnangei han thîng nin tih. Ke sena ranga se thei no tunui,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Masikin Juda rachamneipungeiin, “Ke sena ranga se thei no tunui a ti hih amananâkin inthat rang a tina mini?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Jisua'n a thuon ngeia, “Nangni chu hi rammuola mi nin ni. Kei chu chung tieng renga juong ki ni. Nangni chu hi rammuol renga nin ni, hannirese kei chu hi rammuol renga ni mu-ung. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Masika han nin sietnangei han thîng nin tih, tiin nangni ki ril ani. Male ‘Keima hih tumo Ki ni’ mi nin iem nônchu nin sietnangei han thi lelê nin tih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Anni ngei han, “Tumo ni ni?” tiin an rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:25">Jisua'n, “Aphut<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:25: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aphut renga nangni ki ril ani; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ithomo ma ngei murdi hi nin kôm ki ti?</char></note> renga nangni ki ril ani. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>Nin chungroia hin misîr rang tamtak, nangni demna rang tamtak ko dôn. I-ih khomnirese, mi tîrpu chu mi diktak ani, ama renga ki riet kai ke rammuola ki ril ngâi ani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Jisua'n an kôm, Pa chungroi kêng a misîr ani ti riet thei mak ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Masikin an kôm, “Miriem Nâipasal hih nin makhâi tika ‘Ama hah Keima ki ni’; ti le keima ka rachamin ite tho mu unga, Pa'n mi minchu kai ke ki misîr ani tiin riet sa nin tih. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Male mi tîrpu chu ko kôm a oma; ke thenin mi mâkrak maka, a lungdo ki sin bang ngâi sikin,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>Jisua'n thurchi a misîr ngei hah mi tamtakin an rieta, ama an iem zoi.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chongtakin nangni min mojôk atih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Masikin Jisua'n ama iem Judangei kôm han, “Ki minchuna nin jômin chu ku ruoisi diktak ngei nin ni rang; <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>chongtak riet nin ta, chongtak han nangni mojôk atih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Anni ngei han, “Abraham richisuonpârngei kêng kin ni, tute suoka la om mak me. ‘Suok renga nangni mojôk atih,’ ni ti hih khoi tina mini?” tiin an thuona. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:9">Mat 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:8">Luk 3:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 8:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Chongdiktak nangni ki ril: tukhom nunsie tho chu nunsie suok ani. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Suok chu insûngmi ni tit ngâi mak, aniatachu Nâipasal chu kumtuongin a om ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Nâipasalin suok nangni a mojôk vaiin kêng nin jôk tatak rang. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>Abraham richisuonpârngei nin ni ti ki riet. Hannoma nangnin ma that rangin nin pût ani, ki minchuna chong nin pom loi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Keiman ki misîr hih ka Pa mi min mu ani, nangni khom nin pa ngei nangni an ril anghan nin misîr ngâi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Anni ngei han, “Kin pa chu Abraham ani,” tiin an thuona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:39">Jisua'n an kôm, “Abraham nâi diktak ngei nin ni nisenla chu a lei tho ngâi anghan nin tho<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:39: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nin ni nisenla chu nin tho rang; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nin nîn chu tho.</char></note> rang ani,” tiin chong a mele ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>“Ki sin lei tho ngei murdi chu Pathien renga chongdik ki riet ngei nangni ril hih ani, aniatachu atûn hin ma that rangin nin pût chien ani. Abraham'n chu ma anghin tho ngâi mak! <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Nangni chu nin pa ngei lei tho ngâi anghan nin tho ani,” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Anni ngei han, “Pathien vai kêng kin Pa dôn chu, keini hih a nâi diktak ngei kin ni,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="JHN 8:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Pathien nin Pa ani tatakin chu, mi nin lungkham rang ania; Pathien renga juong ki ni sikin atûn hin nin lâia ko om ani. Keima rachama juong ni mu unga, ama tîr kêng ki ni, a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Ithomo ki misîr hih nin riet thei tet loi? Ku thurchi misîr hih nin mulungrîla nin mindon loi sika ani. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Nin pa Diabol nâingei nin ni, male nin pa lungdo jûi nin nuom ani. Ama chu aphut renga mi that ngâi ani, male chongdik tieng khom inchel ngâi mak, dikna reng a dôn loi sikin. Milak a tho tikin ama lungdoa a tho ani ngâi, milakpa ani sikin, milak ngei murdi pa khom ani sa. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Hannirese keima chu chongtak kêng ki misîr ngâi, masika han nin iem ngâi loi ani. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Nin lâia tumo sietna tienga theiloi mi min chang thei rang? Chongtak ki misîr khomin ithomo nin iem loi? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Tukhom Pathien renga juong chu Pathien chong a pom ngâia. Nikhomrese nangni chu Pathien renga nin ni loi sikin, a chong khom nin rangâi loi ani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua le Abraham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Anni ngei han a kôm, “Nangma hih Samari mi male ramkhori no dôn kin ti hah dik mak mo?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="JHN 8:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Ramkhori dôn mu-ung. Ka Pa ki mirita, aniatachu, nangnin mi nin êsêl ani hi. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Keima rang nanâk miritna rok ni mu unga. Aniatachu, a rokpu le ku ruthûla a jêkpu mi inkhat a om kêng. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>Chongtak nangni ki ril ani: tukhom ko chong jômpu chu thi tet no nih.”<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Anni ngei han a kôm, “Ramkhori no dôn khet tiin kin riet minthâr zoi! Abraham a thi zoia, dêipungei khom an thi suozoi, hannoma nangman chu ‘Ko chong jômpu chu thi tet no ni,’ ni tia, an tipe. <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>Kin Pa Abraham nêkin ni lien uol mo? Ama khom a thi zoi; dêipungei khom an thi suozoi. A tutak hamo ani angin nên bê?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Keima nanâkin miritna a rok ninlang, ha miritna hah chu ite ni no ni. Kin Pathien nin ti, ka Pa hah mirita mi min ompu chu ani, tiin a thuona. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Nangnin chu ama hah riet tet mak chei, keiman chu ki riet ani. Ama riet mu-ung ki tiin chu nangni angin milak ki ni rang ani. Hannirese, ama ki rieta a chong khom ko jôm ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Nin pa Abraham'n ku juong a mu rang sikin a râiasân oka, ma anghan a mu tataka, a râiasân sabak ani.”<verse eid="JHN 8:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Anni ngei han a kôm, “Kum sômrangnga luo la kâi mak che ngah, Abraham<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:57: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abraham nu mu na?</char><char style="ft" closed="false">; miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Abraham'n nang mu zoi mo?</char></note> nu mu na?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 8:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Chongdik kêng nangni ki ril,” tiin a thuon ngeia, “Abraham ân zir mân khom, ‘Keima’ chu ko om zoi.”<verse eid="JHN 8:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Hanchu a dêngna rang lung an rûta, hannirese Jisua ân thupa, Biekin renga a jôkpai zoi.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n a suok renga mitcho pasal inkhat a mindam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Jisua a lôn lâitakin, asuok renga mitcho pasal inkhat a mua. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>A ruoisingeiin a kôm, “Minchupu, hi mi hih tu sietna sika mitchoa ânzir mo? Ama sietna sika mo, a nulepangei sietnangei sika mo?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="JHN 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Hi pa mitchona hih a sietnangei sika aninônchu a nulepangei sietnangei sika khom ni uol mak. Pathien sinthotheina ranakrât a chunga mu theia aomna ranga ani. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Sûn ani lâi hin, mi tîrpu sin ei tho rang ania; jân ajîng rang kêng ani zoi, ma tikin chu tutên sin tho thei khâi no ni ngei. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Rammuola ko om kâr chu rammuol minvârpu ki ni,” a tia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:14">Mat 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:12">Joh 8:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>Ma hah a ti suole chu, Jisua'n pil a michila, a michil leh han dielnâng a sinna; dielnâng hah a mit ngeia a pol pea, <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>male a kôm, “Sênla, Siloam dîla na mâi va phia roh,” a tia. (Siloam riming aomtie chu “Tîr” tina ani.) Ma anghan ha mi hah a sea, a mâi a va phia, a mit avârin a hong kîr nôk zoi ani.<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>Hanchu a bungmingei le a kutdo lâi a lei mu ngâi ngei han, “Hi mi hih ânsunga a kutdo ngâipu ha nimak mo?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Mi senkhatin chu, “Hi mi hih ani,” an tia, aniatachu adangngeiin chu, “Hi mi hih nimak; ânphuopui kêng ani,” an tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:9">Masikin amananâkin, “Ha mi hah ki ni,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Anni ngei han, “Kho angin mo ni mit ahong vâr nôk?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="JHN 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>Ama han, “Mi inkhat Jisua an ti pu han dielnâng a sina, ki mita a pola, male Siloam dîla sênla, na mâi va phia roh a tia. Ma anghan ke sea, ka mâi ka va phia suo renghan chu ku mu thei kelen ani,” tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>“Ama hah khonmo aom?” tiin an rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:12">Ama han, “Riet mu-ung” tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Phariseengei mitchopa damna roi an sûi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Hanchu mitcho lei ni pu ha Phariseengei kôm an tuonga. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Jisua'n dielnâng a sina a mit jîng a mindam pe ni ha Sabbathni ani. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Phariseengeiin a mit hong vâr pe nôk chang ha an rekel nôka. Ama han, “Ki mita dielnâng a pola, ka mâi ka va phia male atûn chu ko hong mu thei zoi ani,” tiin a ril ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Pharisee senkhatin chu, “Hi sin thopu hih Pathien renga juong ni thei no ni, Sabbathni Balam a jôm loi sikin,” an tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:16">Senkhat nôkin chu, “Kho angin mo mi nunsien, hi anga sininkhêlngei hih a sin thei ranga?” an tia. Male an lâia insenna aom zoi.<verse eid="JHN 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Masikin Phariseengeiin ha mi hah vêlkhat an rekel nôka, “Ki mitcho mi minvâr pe, ni tia, asa, nangman te kho angin mo ama chungroi hih ani ni ti?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 9:17">Ama han, “Dêipu ani,” tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>I-ih khomnirese Juda rachamneipungei han ha mi hah mitchôn ân zira, atûn chu a mu thei zoi ani ti iem thei mak ngei sikin a nulepangei an koia, <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>male an kôm, “Hi mi hih nin nâipasal mo? Asuok renga a mitcho nin ti pu ha mo ani hi; kho angin mo atûn hin a hong mu thei nôk hi?” tiin an rekel ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>A nulepangei han, “Hi mi hih kin nâipasal ani, asuok renga a mitcho ani ti khom kin riet. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Aniatachu kho angin mo a mit ahong vâr pe, le tumo a mindam pe chu riet mak me. Ama rekel roi; ulien kêng ani zoi, male amananâkin thuon rese!” <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>A nulepangei han Juda rachamneipungei an chi sikin ma anghan an ti ani. Tukhomin Jisua ha Messiah ani tiin an iema anîn chu Synagog renga notpai rang tiin an lei inruol sai ani. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Masika han kêng a nulepangei, “Ulien ke ani zoi, ama rekel roi!” an tina ani.<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Mitchopa hah a voiniknân an koi nôka, male a kôm, “Pathien makunga chongdik ril rangin chonginkhâm roh! Nang mindampu hah mi nunsie ani tiin kin riet zoi,” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>Ama han an kôm, “Mi nunsie ani mo niloi mo ite riet mu unga. Ki riet chu mitcho ki nia, atûn chu ku mu thei zoi,” tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Anni ngei han, “Khoimo nang a tho pe? Kho angin mo ni mitcho a mindam?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="JHN 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>Ama han an kôm, “Michin khom nangni ki ril zoi. Ithomo a riet nin nuom nôka? Nangni khom a ruoisingei chang nin nuom mini?” tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Anni ngei han khomâk an sâma, “Nangma hih ama ruoisi ni ni, keini chu Moses ruoisingei kêng kin ni, an tia. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Moses kôm Pathien a lei chong ti kin riet; i-ih khomnirse hi mi rang hih chu kho renga hong mo ani khom riet mak me!” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Ha mi han, “Ma tak hah neinun kamâm aomna! Nangni chu kho renga mo ani khom riet mak chei, aniatachu ki mitjîng mi minvâr pe ani! tiin a thuona. <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>Pathien'n mi nunsiengei chong rangâi ngâi mak ti ei rieta; ama jâ ngei le a lungdo sin ngei chong chu a rangâi ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Rammuol insieng phut renga tutên mitcho saia suok a mit a minvâr pe ti la riet ngâi mak me. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Hi mi hih Pathien renga juong ni no rese chu hi anga sin hih tho thei no nih.”<verse eid="JHN 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Anni ngei han, “Nangma nunsie'a ânzir le hong lien hin mi minchu rang no bôk mo?” tiin an thuona. Male ama hah Synagog renga an notpai zoi.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rathatienga mitchona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Jisua'n ha mi hah notpai ani zoi, ti a rietin chu ava roka, a kôm, “Miriem Nâipasal hih ni iem mo?” tiin a rekela.<verse eid="JHN 9:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Ama han, “Pu, tumo ani ni ril roh, ki iem theina rangin!” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 9:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Ama hah nu mu sai kêng, male atûna nang chongpuipa hih ama hah ani,” a tipea.<verse eid="JHN 9:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Ha mi han, “Pumapa, ki iem!” a tia, male Jisua kebula khûk ân bila.<verse eid="JHN 9:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Jisua'n, “Hi rammuola hin roijêk ranga juong ki ni, masikin mitcho ngei an mit a vârna rang le mitvâr ngei an mitchona rangin,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Phariseengei senkhat a kôla om ngei han ma chong hah an rieta male a kôm, “Adiktakin keini khom hi mitcho kin ni sa ni tina nimak mo?” tiin an rekela.<verse eid="JHN 9:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Mitcho nin ni nisenla chu theiloina dôn no tu nui; hannirese kin mu thei nin ti sikin nin theiloina ala om bang ani.” tiin a thuon ngei.<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Belrihôlpu chongmintêk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Jisua'n a tia, “Chongdik tak nangni ki ril: mi tukhom belrirukul kotbâia lût loia lam dang tienga kala lût chu inru le râtlâksong ani. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Mi tukhom kotbâi tieng renga lût chu belrihôlpu ani. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Kotbâi ngâkpu han kotbâi a mo-ong pea; belringeiin a rôl an rieta, a belringei chu an riming chitin a koia, a ruoi ngei ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>A kaisuo ngei suole chu ama moton ânsa pe ngeia, male a rôl an riet sikin, belringeiin a nûk an jûi ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Midang chu tute jûi no ni ngei; a rôl an riet loi sikin, jûi nêkin tân pe pat an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Jisua'n hi chongmintêk hi a misîr pe ngeia, hannirese imo a tina riet mak ngei.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Belrihôlpu sa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Masikin Jisua'n a ti nôka, “Chongdiktak nangni ki ril: Keima hi belringei ranga kotbâi ki ni. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Ko motona lei juong ngei murdi chu inru ngei le râtlâksong ngei an nia, belringei khomin an chong rangâi ngâi mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>Keima hih kotbâi ki ni. Tukhom keima taka lût chu sanminringin om an tih; asûnga lût an ta, jôk an ta, sûlring man sâng an tih. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Inru chu muruk rang, that rang le sietminmang rang vaiin kêng an hong ngâi. Kei chu ringna nin dôna ranga ringna akipdira nin dôna ranga juong ki ni.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>“Keima hi belrihôlpu sa, a belringei ta ranga a ringna phal nuom ki ni. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Inlo mi, belrihôlpu dikloi le belringei khom ata aniloi sikin, melang hong a mûn chu belringei a mâkraka male a tân pata; masikin melangin belringei a peta, chek a minchâinek ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Inlo mi han a tân pata asikchu ama hah inlo mi le belringei rangin lunghâng a dôn loi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 10:13"/><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14-15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:27">Mat 11:27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:22">Luk 10:22</ref></char></note> Keima hi belrihôlpu sa ki ni. Pa'n mi riet anghan kei khom Pa ki rieta, ma-angdên han ke belringei chu ki rieta anni ngei khomin min riet ani. An ta ranga thi khom hih ku nuom ani. <verse eid="JHN 10:14-15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Hi belrirukula la om loi belri dang khom ka la dôn sa. Mangei ha khom la hongtuong sa ka ta, anni ngei han ke he rangâi an ta, male belri pâlkhat la hongni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hongni an ta; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hong om an tih.</char></note> an tih, belrihôlpu inkhat lehan.<verse eid="JHN 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>“Man nôk ranga ki ringna pêk rang ku nuom sikin, Pa'n mi lungkham ngâi ani. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Tutên ki ringna hi mi lâk pe thei noni ngei. Keima rachamin kêng ke pêk rang ani. A pêk thei ki nia, male a lâk nôk thei khom ki ni. Mahi kêng tho rangin ka Pa'n chong mi pêk ani.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Hi chongngei sika hin mipuingei lâia insenna aom nôk zoi. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Mi tamtakin, “Ramkhori sûr! Achâng kêng! Ithomo a chong nin rangâi pea?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Aniatachu adangngeiin chu, “Ramkhori sûr chu ma anghin chong thei no nih! Kho angin mo ramkhorin mi mitcho amin vâr pe thei ranga?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua hih hengpaiin aom zoi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Ma zora hah phalbi lâi ania, Biekin ranga Inpêklet khohoi Jerusalema an mang lâitak ani. <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>Jisua chu Solomon bokropa han a vân lôi a hôn lôia, <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>mingei ha a kôla an hôn tûpa, “Idôr sôt mo mulung okchân mi ni dar rang? Ânthârtakin mi ril roh: Messiah mo ni ni?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Nangni ki ril zoi duo, aniatachu mi iem mak chei. Ka Pa rachamneinân a sin ko tho hin ku ruthûlin nangni a min riet ania; <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>hannirese iem no tunui, ke belringei nin ni loi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>Ke belringeiin chu ko rôl an riet ngâi; kei khomin ki riet ngei, male annin min jûi ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>An kôm kumtuong ringna ke pêk ngeia, male anni ngei hah thi tet khâi no ni ngei. Tutên keima renga mi sut thei no ni ngei. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>Anni ngei ni pêkpu ka Pa hah neinunngei murdi nêkin ânlal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:29: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ka Pa'n ni pêk hih ânlal uol; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ka Pa, anni ngei ko kôm ni pêkpu, hih ânlal uol.</char></note> uol ani, male tutên Pa donsûina renga mi sut thei no ni ngei. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Pa le keima chu inkhat kin ni.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Hanchu mingeiin ama dêngna rang lung an rût nôka. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Pa'n sin ranga mi pêk sin sa tamtak nin mitmua ki sin zoia, akhotak sika ha mo lung leh ni dêng rang nin bôkna reng hi?” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Anni ngei han, “Sin sa sikin lung leh nang dêng rang nuom mak mea, aniatachu Pathien riming ni rilminsiet! sikin le miriem ni ni ngonga Pathien'n nên bê sikin ani,” tiin an thuona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Och 24:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Nin Balam lekhabua Pathien'n a tia, ‘pathienngei nin ni,’ tiin ânziek nimak mo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 82:6">Lap 82:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>Ei riet anghan Pathien lekhabua ati kai chu tuonsôtin adik ngâi ania; male Pathien'n a chong a min tungna ngeia khom han pathienngei a ti ani. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Keima rang chu Pa'n mi thanga rammuola mi juongtîr ani. Nônte, kho angin mo Pathien Nâipasal ki ni ki ti sika hin Pathien ni rilminsiet mi nin ti hi? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Ka Pa'n sin ranga mi nuom neinunngei ha ki sin ani nônchu mi iem no roi. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Hannirese ki sin anîn chu keima mi nin iem no khomin, ki sinthongei luo hi iem roi bah, Pa keima kôm a om male keima Pa kôm ko om ti nin riet minthâr theina rangin,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 10:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Jisua sûr rang an pût nôkrêka, aniatachu an kut renga a jôkpai pe ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Hanchu Jisua hah Jordan Tuidung râla motona John'n mi a baptisna ngâi mun tieng han a sea, male mahan a om zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:28">Joh 1:28</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Mi tamtak a kôm an honga. “John'n ite sininkhêlngei sin mak,” aniatachu, “Hipa chungroi a lei misîr murdi chu adik ani,” an tia. <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Male mahan mi tamtakin ama an iem zoi.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Lazarus thi thurchi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Mi inkhat a riming Lazarus, Bethany khopuia om hah damloiin a oma. Bethany hah Mary le a zuorpuinu Martha ngei omna khopui ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:38">Luk 10:38</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 10:39">39</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>(Hi Mary hih Pumapa kea mirimhoi buoka male a sam leh a ke hûi pe nu hah ani, damloia om Lazarus hah a nuchapa ani.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 12:3">Joh 12:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>A sarnungeiin Jisua kôm, “Pumapa, na malpa lungkham hih dam mak,” tiin chong an muthuona.<verse eid="JHN 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Jisua'n maha a riet lehan, “Hi Lazarus natna hih thina rang nimaka; Pathien roiinpuina ranga ania, hi sika hin Pathien Nâipasal khom roiinpuiin ala om rang ani,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Jisua'n Martha le a zuorpuinu le Lazarus ngei hah a lungkham ngei tataka. <verse eid="JHN 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Hannoma damloi thurchi hah a riet suo nûkin a omna mun han sûnnik ala om nôka. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Hanchu a ruoisingei kôm, “Judea rama se nôk ei ti u zoi,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 11:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>A ruoisingeiin a kôm, “Minchupu, nikhatni renghan mingeiin lung leh nang dêng rang an tia, hannoma la se nôk rêk rang ni mintuo mini?” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="JHN 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Jisua'n a tia, “Sûnkhatin konta sômleinik aom nimak mo?” Masikin tukhomin sûn khovâra an lônin chu invâi ngâi mak ngeia, hi rammuol vâr hih an mu sikin. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Aniatachu, jân jînghamin an lônin chu an invâi ngâi, vâr an dôn loi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>Jisua'n hi chong hih a tia, hanchu a bôksa nôka, “Ei malpa Lazarus chu a in zoi, hannirese ama kaithoi rangin ke se rang ani,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Ruoisingeiin, “Pumapa, a in anînchu, hong dam nôk atih zoi,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="JHN 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Jisua'n chu Lazarus a thi zoi a tina ani. aniatachu, annîn chu in ngâi balama a in mini tiin an bôka. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Masikin Jisua'n ânthârin a ril ngeia, “Lazarus a thi zoi, <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>hannirese a kôm ko om loi ha nangni rang sikin ka râiasân ani, nin iem theina rangin. Tho a kôm se ei tih u zoi.”<verse eid="JHN 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Thomas (Ânphîr an ti) han a champui ruoisingei kôm, “Tho Minchupu kôm ei rêngin se sa ei ta, ama leh ei thi theina rangin!” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Inthoinôkna le Ringna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Jisua a hongtungin chu, Lazarus ha sûn minli moton han an phûm zoi ti a rieta. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>Bethany hah Jerusalem renga kilometer inthum nêka nâi uol ani, <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>male Judangei mi tamtakin Mary le Martha ngei an nuchapa thi chungroia mathâi rangin an honga.<verse eid="JHN 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Martha'n Jisua a hong ti a rietin chu ama intongpui rangin a jôka, aniatachu Mary chu insûnga a lei oma. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Martha'n Jisua kôm, “Pumapa, hin no om nisenla chu ku nuchapa hi thi no nih! <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Aniatachu atûn khom Pathien kôm no zong kai chu nang pêk a tih, ti ki riet,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Nu nuchapa inthoinôk atih,” tiin a rila.<verse eid="JHN 11:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Amanu han, “Sûn nûktaka chu inthoi nôk a tih, ti ki riet,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Jisua'n amanu kôm han, “Keima hi inthoinôkna le ringna ki ni. Tukhom mi iem kai chu thi khomsenla ngei ring an tih; <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>male tukhom a ringa keima mi iem chu thi tet no ni ngei. Ma hih ni iem mo?” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>Amanu han a kôm, “Ani, Pumapa!” ki iem. “Nangma hih Messiah, Pathien Nâipasal, rammuola juong rangpu ha ni ni ti ki iem tatak,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua a chap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>Martha'n hi chong hih a ti suole chu a zuorpuinu Mary a theia om hah inrûktên ava koia. “Minchupu hin a oma, nang a koi,” tiin a rila. <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Hi chong hih Mary a rietin chu innottakin ânthoia, ama leh intong rangin a sea. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>(Jisua ha khuo sûnga la hongtung maka. Martha leh an intongna muna han a la om.) <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Insûnga Mary mathâi ranga ompui mipuingei han Mary innotin ânthoia, a jôk an mûn chu thânna chap rangin a se mini tiin an mindona, an jûi zoi.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>Mary hah Jisua omna a hongtunga, ava mu renghan a ke bula an bokraka. “Pumapa,” hin, “no om nisenla chu ku nuchapa hi thi no nih!” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Jisua'n Mary chap le a hong jûi mipuingei chap ha a mun chu asân a mulung a jûrpuia, a rîl tieng ân nûkka. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>“Ama hah khonmo nin phûm?” tiin a rekel ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:34">“Pumapa, hong inla hong en roh,” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Jisua a chap zoi. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Mipuingei han, “En ta u, idôrtaka a lungkham mini na!” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 11:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Aniatachu senkhatin, “Mitchopa ha mitvârna a pêk nimak mo? Lazarus khom hi thi loiin a dar thei loi mini?” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lazarus hih minringin aom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Jisua ha arîl tieng ânnuk nôka, thâna a sea, thân khur ha ânpûk, lung leh alûtna hah an hîp ani. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Jisua'n, “Lung hi thînpai roi!” tiin a dânde ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 11:39">Martha, a thipa sarnu han, “Pumapa, a mirim asie rang kêng ani zoi, an phûmna sûn minli piel ani zoi!” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Jisua'n amanu kôm han, “Ni iemin chu Pathien roiinpuina mu ni tih, nang ki ti nimak mo?” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Lung hah an thînpai zoia. Jisua a tanga, “Pa, ko chong na rangâi sikin ka râiasân. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>Ko chong na rangâi bang ngâi ti ki riet, hannirese mahi chu hi taka om mipuingei hin nangma mi ni tîr ki ni, ti an iem theina rangin nang ki ti ani.” <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>Ma ha a ti suole chu, rôl inringtakin a koisama, “Lazarus hong jôk roh!” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Ama hah a kutngei le kengei thân puonngeiin intuomchienin, a mâi khom puon leh intuomchienin a hong jôk zoia. Jisua'n an kôm, “Sût ungla, male min se roi,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua that rangtie an mintuo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Mk 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luk 22:1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Mi tamtak Mary hong pan ngei han, Jisua sintho hah an mua, male ama an iem kelen zoi. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Aniatachu, mi senkhatin chu an kîr nôka, Phariseengei kôm Jisua sintho hah an va misîr pe ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Masikin Phariseengei le ochaisingei, roijêkpungei leh an intonga, “Imo ei tho rang ani zoi? Hipa hin sininkhêl a sin ngei hih en ta u! <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Hima anghin ei min se bangin laka mitinin hong iem an ta, hanchu Roman rachamneipungei juong an ta, ei Biekin le ei jât le nam min juong sietminmang pe rang kêng!” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>An lâia mi inkhat, a riming Caiaphas hah, ma kuma Ochai Inlaltak han an kôm, “Nin mo babâka! <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Mi murdi thia, jât le nam pumpui ânmang nêkin chu mi inkhat thi hah asa uol ti nin riet loi mini?” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>Adikin, chu ama thena mulungbôka a ti nimaka; ha kuma Ochai Inlaltak ani sikin Jisua hah Juda mipuingei ruthûla a thi rang hah a lei ril masa ani. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>male anni rang vai niloiin, Pathien mi chekinchâia om ngei pâl khata a molom theina rangin khom ani sa.<verse eid="JHN 11:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Hani renga chu Juda rachamneipungeiin Jisua an that rang chang an mintuo bang ani. <verse eid="JHN 11:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Masikin Jisua khom ânlangin chu Judea rama lêng khâi maka, ramchâr kôla khopui inkhat a riming Ephraim an tia han a sea, a ruoisingei leh an va om zoi.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Kalkân Kût anâi zoi sikin mi tamtakin ram sûng pumpui renga inthieng-inthâr rangin khohoi phâk mân Jerusalema an sea. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Jisua an rok titira, Biekina an intûp lâiin inkhat le khat annin rekela, “Imo nin mindon? Khohoia hong tatak no ni mo, a hong rang mo?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Ochaisingei le Phariseengeiin ama an sûr theina rangin tukhomin a omna an rietin chu an misîr ngêt rang ani tiin chong an pêk ngei zoi ani.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Bethany taka Jisua sariek polin aom</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mat 26:6-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mk 14:3-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>Kalkân kût rang sûnruk motona Jisua chu thina renga a kaithoi Lazarus omna Bethany khuoa a sea. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Ama rangin kholoibu nêk rang an mintuo pea, Martha hah bu-an, semin a san ngeia, Lazarus chu dosânga Jisua bukhalâi otpui ngei lâia inkhat ani. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Hanchu Mary'n nard sariek mirimhoi man luttak liter in-ang a hong chôia, Jisua ke a buoka, a sam leh a ke a hûi pea. Ha sariek mirimhoi han insûng pumpui asip zit zoi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luk 7:37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Jisua ruoisingei lâia inkhat Judas Iscariot, ama a minsûr rangpu han, <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>“Hi sariek mirimhoi hih ithomo duli <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:5: </char><char style="fk" closed="false">sumdâr duli ngei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">6:7 en roh.</char></note> razanthumin juorin male inrieng ngei kôm a pêk loi?” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Hi chong hih inrieng ngei rang lunghâng ân shak sika a ti nimaka, inru ani sika ani. Ha mi han sumkok a chôia asûnga sum hah ama rangin a lâk ngâi sikin ani.<verse eid="JHN 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Aniatachu, Jisua'n a kôm, “Rokôk no roh! a dôn hih phûma ko om nia rangin rê rese. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Inrieng ngei chu nin kôma om tit rang an ni, kei chu nin kôm om bang no ning,” a tia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Bal 15:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lazarus that rangtie an mintuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Mi tamtakin Bethany khuoa Jisua a om ti an rietin chu Jisua mu rangin le Lazarus Jisua'n thina renga a kaithoi nôkpu mu sa rangin an sea. <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Hanchu Ochaisingei han Lazarus khom that sa rangin an bôka, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>ama sika Juda tamtakin anni ngei hengin Jisua an iem zoi sikin.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua inlaltakin Jerusalema a lût</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mk 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Anangtûka chu Kalkân kût khohoia hong loko tamtakin Jisua Jerusalema a hong ti an rieta. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Masikin letûmbuongei an chôia ama lamdon rangin an sea, “Hosanna! Pumapa riminga juongpu chu Pathien'n satvur rese! Pathien'n Israel Rêngpa satvur rese!” tiin an inieka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Lap 118:25</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 118:26">26</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Jisua'n sakuording inkhat a mua, a chunga a chuonga, Pathien Lekhabu'n ati anghan,<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>“Chi no roh, Zion khopuilien!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">Ne Rêng hah sakuordingte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:15">chunga chuongin a hong ani.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zak 9:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Ha chong hah aphut han chu a ruoisingeiin riet thei mak ngeia; aniatachu Jisua inlaltakin inthoiin a om suo tena chu Pathien Lekhabu'n ama chungroi a lei miziek ani ti le a chunga ha anga han an lei tho ti an riet zoi.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Jisua'n Lazarus thân renga a koi suoka, thina renga a kaithoi lâia mipui om ngei han a thurchi an misîr tir zoia. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Ha sininkhêl hah an riet sikin mipui ngeiin an lei don ani. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Hanchu Phariseengei han, “En ta u, ite chang khâi mak me! En roi, rammuol pumpuiin ama kêng an jûi zoi hi!” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Greekngei senkhatin Jisua an rok</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Khohoia Pathien chubaimûk ranga Jerusalema hong se ngei lâia han Greekngei senkhat an oma. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Anni ngei han Philip (Galilee rama Bethsaida khuo mi) kôm an sea, “Pu, Jisua mu kin nuom,” tiin an ngêna.<verse eid="JHN 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Philip a sea male Andrew ava rila, male anruonin an sea, Jisua an va rila. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Miriem Nâipasal inlaltaka a om zora atung zoi. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>Chongdiktak nangni ki ril: buhûm pila a tâka athi nônchu aramalin aom chien ngâi, athin vai kêng tamtakin ânra ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Tukhom an ringna moroi kaiin machân an ta, tukhom rammuola an ringna min pâm loi kaiin kumtuong ringna dôn tit an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:25">16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mk 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luk 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Tukhom ki sintho nuom kaiin chu mi jûi ngêt rese ngei, masikin ki sinthopu ngei chu ko omna an om sa theina rangin. Tukhom ki sintho ngâi kai chu ka Pa'n mirit tho ngei atih.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n a thi rang roi a misîr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>“Atûn hin ku mulung akâng male imo ki ti rang ani zoi? ‘Pa, hi zora hih ku chunga mi mintung pe no roh ki ti rang mini’? Aniatachu, hi dûktuong rang piela juong ki ni, masika han hi dûktuongna zora hih palin ke se rang ani. <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>Pa, ni riming roiinpuina juong mintung roh!” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:28">Hanchu invân renga rôl ajuon ringa, “Ko roiinpuina ku juong mintung zoi, la juong mintung nôk ki tih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Lokongei a kôla ânding ngei han ma rôl hah an rieta, male an lâia senkhatin, khuonri kêng ani an tia, adangngeiin chu, “Vântîrtonin a chongpui kêng!” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Aniatachu Jisua'n an kôm, “Ma rôl ha keima ranga ajuon ring nimaka, nangni ngei rang kêng ani. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Atûn hin hi rammuol roijêkin aom rang zora ani zoi; hi rammuol roijêkpu khom hi atûn, pai nîng atih. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Pilchung renga makhâiin ko om tikin chu mi murdi ki tieng kaikuoi ki tih,” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>(Hi chong hih thina a tuong rangtie riet theina ranga a ti ani.)<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Mipuingeiin a kôm, “Kin Balam lekhabu'n Messiah chu tuonsôtin ring tit atih” tiin mi ril ngâi. Hanchu, kho angin mo nangman, “Miriem Nâipasal hi târin om atih, ni ti thei? Hi Miriem Nâipasal hih tumo ani?” tiin an thuona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:4">Lap 110:4</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:25">Ezek 37:25</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 7:14">Dan 7:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Vâr hi chomolte chu nin lâia la om nîng atih. Vâr nin dôn lâiin lêng roi, masika han ijîngin nangni adê loina rangin; tukhom ijînga a lônin chu a sena riet ngâi mak. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Vâr nin dôn lâihin vâr hi iem ta roi, avâr mingei nin ni theina rangin,” a tia.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:36">Mingei iemloina</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:36">Jisua'n hi chong hih a ti suole chu a thengpata, an mu thei loina ranga a vânthup zoi. <verse eid="JHN 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>An mitmua sininkhêlngei tamtak a sin suonûk khomin anni ngei han ama iem mak ngeia, <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>masikin dêipu Isaiah lei ti hah ahong tung adik theina rangin: <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Isa 53:1</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:38">“Pumapa, kin thurchi misîr tumo a iema?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:38">Tu chunga mo Pumapa'n arnak a minlang?”<verse eid="JHN 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Male masika hi an iem thei loi ani, Isaiah nanâkin a tia:<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>“Pathien'n an mit a mincho pe ngeia <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:10">Isa 6:10</ref> (LXX)</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">male an mulungbôkngei khom a min môl pe ngei sa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">masikin an mitin an mu loina rang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">le an mulungbôkngei khomin an rietthei loina rangin,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">male ko kôm an hônhei nôk duoia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 12:40">ke lei mindam ngei theina rangin, Pathien'n a tia.”<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Isaiah han Jisua roiinpuina a mu le a thurchi a misîr sikin hi chong hih a ti ani.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Nikhomsenla Juda rachamneipu tamtak ngeiin Jisua an iem zoia; hannirese Phariseengei sikin misîr minlang ngam mak ngeia, ma anghan ani nônchu synagog renga khâipaiin an om rang ani. <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>Pathien pomna nêkin munisi pomna an min lut uol ani.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua chongbâingei roijêkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Jisua'n rôl inringtakin a tia, “Tukhom mi iempu chu keima mi iem vai niloiin mi tîrpu khom a iem sa ani. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Tukhom keima mi mu chu mi tîrpu khom a mu sa ani. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>Rammuola hin vâr angin ku juong ani, masikin tukhom mi iem ngei murdi chu ijînga an om loina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Tukhom ku thurchi misîr a rieta a jôm loi khom nisenla, keiman an roijêk no ning. Rammuol roijêk ranga juong ni mu unga, rammuol sanminring ranga juong kêng ki ni. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Tukhom keima me henga, ku thurchi misîr pomloi ngei chu anni ngei roijêk rangin mi inkhat aom. Ku thurchi misîr ha sûn nûktaka chu anni ngei roijêkpu la ning atih! <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Mahi adik ani, asikchu Keima ka rachamin ite misîr ngâi mu unga, ka Pa mi tîrpu'n kêng ki ti rang le ki misîr rang chong mi pêk ngâi ani. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Male a chongpêk ngei chu kumtuong ringna ani ti ki riet. Masikin ki ti ngei hi Pa'n mi ril lam angtakin ki misîr ani,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n a ruoisingei kengei a rusûk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Kalkân kût khohoi rang ni motontet ahong ni zoia. Jisua'n hi rammuol hih mâkin Pa kôm a se rang zora atung zoi ti a rieta. Ama ta ngei lelê, hi rammuola om, a lungkham ngâi ngei hah among ni dênin a lungkham ngei tita.<verse eid="JHN 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Jisua le a ruoisingei jânbu an nêk han. Diabol'n Simon Iscariot nâipasal Judas mulungrîla Jisua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Diabol ha Jisua minsûr rangin; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Diabol'n Simon Iscariot nâipasal Judas ha, Jisua minsûr rangin, a lei masat suo zoi ani.</char></note> minsûr rangin mindonna a lei dar chien zoia. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Jisua hah, Pa'n rachamneina murdi a pêk, ti le Pathien renga juong ania, Pathien kôm se nôk rang ani ti a rieta. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Masikin bukhalâi otna dosâng kung renga ânthoia, a chunghak kâncholi a kheka, male inhûinapuon a lâka, a kong a khita. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>Hanchu dabôra tui a sunga, ruoisingei kengei a rusûk phut zoia, a konga puon lehan a hûi pe ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>Simon Peter kôm a honga, ama han, “Pumapa nangman ke kengei nursûk rang mo?” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Ki sintho hi atûn chu la riet mak che, hannirese nangkana chu la riet ni tih,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Peter'n a kôm, “Nangman chu khotiklâi khom ka kengei rusûk tet no ti nih!” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:8">Jisua'n a kôm, “Ne kengei kursûk nônchu ku ruoisi ni khâi no tinih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simon Peter'n a kôm, “Pumapa, nônchu ke kengei vai rusûk nônla, ku kutngei le ku lu khom rusûk sa roh!” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">13:10: </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">an ke tilloiin chu ti hih </char>
      <char style="fq" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei chu dôn mak ngei.</char>
    </note>Jisua'n a tia, “Tukhom tui ânbuol sai chu asâi zoi ani, a kengei tilloiin chu adang arsûk rang nâng khâi maka. Nin lâia mi inkhat tiloiin chu nin rêngin nin sâivar zoi.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>(Jisua'n a minsûr rangpu ha a riet chien sai ani; sikin, “Nin lâia mi inkhat, tiloiin chu, nin rêngin nin sâivar zoi,” a ti ani)<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>Jisua'n an kengei arsûk suole chu a chunghak kâncholi a haka male a mun nanâka dosâng tieng a kîr nôka. “Nin chunga ki sintho hih nin riet thei mo?” tiin a rekel ngeia. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12-15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:27">Luk 22:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>“Nangnin Minchupu le Pumapa mi nin tia, nin ti mindik ani, asikchu ni khom ki ni tatak ani. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Keima, nin Pumapa le Minchupu'n luo nin kengei ku rusûk ani, Ma anghan, nangni khom nin kengei nin rusûk inlôm rang ani. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Nin chunga ko tho anghin nangni khomin nin tho theina rangin nangni ki min mu ani. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>Chongdiktak nangni ki ril: suokngei hih an pu nêkin lien mak ngeia, thangtheipungei khom a tîrpu nêkin lien mak ngei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">Joh 15:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Atûn chu ma chongdik hah nin riet zoi, nin jômin chu nin râisân tatak atih!<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>“Nin renga nin thurchi misîr mu-ung, ka thang ngei chu keiman ki riet. Hannirese Pathien Lekhabu'n, ‘Ku bu nêkpu han mi doi zoi,’ a ti ha ahong dik ngêt anâng ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Lap 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>Masikin mahi atûn ahongtung mân nangni ke lei ril ani, ahongtung tika khom ‘Ama ha Keima hi Ki Ni,’ tiin mi nin iem theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>Chongdiktak nangni ki ril: tukhom ki mi tîr lei pom chu keima khom mi pom sa ania; male tukhom mi pom chu mi tîrpu khom a pom ani,” a tia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10:40</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mk 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luk 9:48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">10:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n minsûra aom rang a leiphuong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26:20-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mk 14:17-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>Jisua'n ma chong hah a ti suole chu a mulung dûk a min tonga, “Chongdiktak nangni ki ril: nin lâia mi inkhatin mi minsûr atih,” tiin ânlangiemin a phuonga.<verse eid="JHN 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>Ruoisingei han tu lelê mo a tina tak an riet loi sikin jâminzal takin annîn en inlôma. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>Ruoisingei lâia mi inkhat Jisua'n a lungkham ngâipu hah Jisua kôla ânsunga. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Hapa kôm han Simon Peter'n, “Tutak mo a ti, rekel ta,” tiin kut leh tônin a chongpuia.<verse eid="JHN 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Masikin ama ha Jisua tieng ân thîna, “Pumapa, tu lelê mo ani?” tiin a rekela.<verse eid="JHN 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Vâipôl hârte michie ka ta, ke pêk tak hah ning atih,” tiin a thuona. Masikin vâipôl hârte a lâka, a michie-a, Simon Iscariot nâipasal Judas kôm a pêk zoi. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Judas'n vâipôl hârte ha a lâk suo, harenghan a sûnga han Soitan alût kelen zoi. Jisua'n a kôm, “No tho rang tak hih tholai roh!” a tipea. <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Dosâng rihîla om adangngei han tutên ithomo ma anghan Jisua'n a tipe riet mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Ruoisingei senkhatin chu Judas han sum a kol sikin, Jisua'n khohoia mang rang neinun ânsam rochôk roh a tipe mini, aninônchu inrieng ngei imini pêk roh a tipe mini tiin an bôka.<verse eid="JHN 13:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Judas han vâipôl hâr hah a lâka, a rotpat kelen zoi, ma zora hah jân ani.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chongpêk athar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>Judas a rotpat suole chu Jisua'n an kôm a tia, “Atûn chu Miriem Nâipasal roiinpuina ânlang zoia, ama sikin Pathien roiinpuina khom ânlang zoi ani. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Male ama renga Pathien roiinpuina ânlangin chu, Pathien khomin ama renga han Miriem Nâipasal roiipuina minlang atih, male ama'n voikhat rengin tho kelen atih. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Ka nâingei, nin lâia zora sôt om khâi no ning. Mi en nin ta; aniatachu Juda rachamneipungei ki tipe ngei anghan nangni ki tipe ani, ‘Ke sena ranga se thei no tunui.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:34">Joh 7:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>Male atûn hin chongpêk athar nangni ke pêk ani: inkhat le inkhat inlungkham inlôm roi. Nangni ku lungkham anghan nin inlungkham ngêt rang ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:12">Joh 15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Joh 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Joh 5</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Inkhat le inkhat nin inlungkham inlômin chu ku ruoisingei nin ni tiin mi murdi'n riet an tih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n, Peter a ipdel rang a leiphuong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mk 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simon Peter'n, “Pumapa, khotieng mo ne se rang?” tiin a rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:36">“Ke sena ranga atûn chu mi la jûi thei no tunui,” aniatachu, “nakana chu mi la jûi nin tih,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Peter'n, “Pumapa, ithomo atûn hin chu nang ku jûi thei loi rang?” tiin a rekela, “Nangma rang sikin chu ki ringna khom pêk ki tih!” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 13:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Keima rang sikin ni ringna ne pêk tatak rang na? Chongdiktak nang ki ril: ârkhuong mân voithum, ama hih riet ngâi mu-ung, ni ti rang ani,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua Pa kôm sena lampui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Jisua'n, “Nin kângmindoi no ungla male nin jâminzal no roi, Pathien iem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Iem; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nin iem.</char></note> roi male kei khom mi iem sa roi. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Ka Pa ina omna khâltan tamtak aom, ninta rangin mun sin ke se rang ani. Om no senla chu nangni ki ril loi rang ani.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mahan om no senla chu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">aninônchu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ka Pa ina han omna khâltan tamtak aoma; om no senla chu, ninta rangin mun sin ke se rang tiin nangni ki ril rang mo?</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>Male ninta rang mun ko hong sin suole chu juongkîr nôk ka ta, ko kôm nangni tuong ki tih, ko omna nangni khom nin om sa theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Ke sena rang lampui khom nin riet.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Thomas'n a kôm, “Pumapa, ne sena rang riet mak me; masikin kho angin mo mataka sena rang lampui ha kin riet ranga?” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Keima hi lampui, chongtak le ringna ki ni; keima taka se loi chu tute Pa kôm tung ngâi mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Atûn chu mi nin riet zoi,” a tipe ngeia, “Ka Pa khom nin riet<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:7: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Atûn chu keima mi nin riet zoi riet nin tih; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Keima mi nin rietin chu nin riet rang ani.</char></note> sa rang ani zoi, male atûn renga chu ama nin riet zoia male mu khom nin mu sa zoi ani.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Philip'n a kôm, “Pumapa, Pa hah keini mi min mu ta; kinta rangin chu hun atih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Philip, hi dôr sôt hih nin kôm ko oma; hannoma mi la riet mak che mo? Tukhom mi mu chu Pa a mu ani. Hanchu, ithomo, ‘Pa hah keini mi min mu ta ni tia’? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>Keima Pa kôm ko oma male Pa khom ko kôm aom hih ni iem loi mini? Nin kôma chong ki ti ngei hah keima renga hong suok nimak,” Pa, ko kôma omtit ngâipu han a sin a tho kêng ani. Jisua'n a ruoisingei kôm a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Keima Pa kôm ko oma, Pa ko kôm aom ki ti hin mi iem roi. Ani nônchu, ki sintho ngei sik luo hin mi iem roi. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>Chongdiktak nangni ki ril: tukhom mi iem ngei chu ki sintho anghin la sin an tih; ani, hima nêka neinun roiinpui uol ngei khom la sin an tih, Pa kôm ke se rang ani sikin. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Male khokhoi khom ki riminga nin zong kai chu sin ki tih, Nâipasal sika Pa roiinpuina ânlang theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Nangnin ki rimingin i-ikhom mi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miziek senkhat ngei an dôn </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mi.</char></note> nin zong kai chu tho ki tih.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ratha Inthieng inkhâm</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>Nangnin mi nin lungkhamin chu ko chongpêkngei jôm nin tih. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Pa kôm zong ka ta, ama'n Sanpu dang nangni pêk atih; tuonsôta nin kôma om rangin. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Ama ha Ratha diktak, Pathien chongtak minlang ngâipu ani. Rammuolin chu modôm thei maka, ama an mu thei loi sik le an riet thei loi sikin. Aniatachu nangni ngeiin chu nin riet, nin kôm a om bang sik le nangnia aom<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:17: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hih; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nîng atih.</char></note> bang ngâi sikin.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>“Ke se khomin nin theivaiin nangni mâk no ninga; nin kôm juong kîr nôk ki tih. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>Chomolte suole chu rammuolin mi mu khâi no ni; hannirese nangnin chu mi mu nin ta, keima ki ring sikin nangni khom ring sa nin tih. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Ma nikhuo hah ahong tungin chu, nangni nin kôm ko om anghan keima ka Pa kôm ko oma, nangni ko kôm nin om tiin riet nin tih zoi.<verse eid="JHN 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>“Tukhom ko chongpêkngei a poma jôm chu mi lungkham ani. Tukhom mi lungkham kai chu ka Pa khomin lungkham atih; kei khomin lungkham ngei ka ta, an kôm inlâr bang ngâi ki tih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Judas (Judas Iscariot niloi) han a kôm, “Pumapa, kin kôm chu inlâr na ta, ithomo rammuol kôm chu nên lâr loi rang?” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 14:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Tukhom mi lungkham ngeiin chu ki minchuna jôm an tih. Ka Pa khomin lungkham ngei a ta, male ka Pa leh an kôm juong kin ta, an kôm om kin tih. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Tukhom mi lungkham loi ngei chu ki minchuna khom jôm ngâi mak ngei. Male minchuna chong nin riet hi keima kata nimaka, Pa, mi tîrpu renga kêng ani.”<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>“Nin kôm ka la om lâihin hi chong hih nangni ki tipe ani. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Sanpu, Ratha Inthieng, Pa'n ki riminga a juongtîr rang han neinunngei murdi nangni minchu a ta, male nangni ki misîr pe sai ngei murdi hah riettit rangin nangni sin a tih.”<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>“Nangni ka mâkpe chu Rathânngamna hi ania; keima rathânngamna kêng nangni ke pêk ani. Rammuolin a pêk anghan chu nangni pêk mu-ung. Nin kângmindoi no ungla, male nin jâmminzal no roi; chi khom chi no roi. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>‘Nangni mâksan rang ki ni, ti nin rieta, aniatachu nin kôm juong kîr nôk ki tih,’ mi nin lungkhama anîn chu Pa kôm ke se hih nin râisân atih; ama chu keima nêkin a roiinpui uol sikin. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Hi chong hih ahongtung mân nangni ke lei ril ani, ahongtung tika nin iem theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>Zora sôt chu nangni chongpui thei khâi no ning, hi rammuola roijêkpu hih a hong zoi sikin. Ku chunga racham dôn maka, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>hannirese Pa ku lungkham ti hih rammuolin a riet ngêt anâng ani; masikin ama chongpêkngei anghan neinuntin ki sin ngâi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 14:31">“Hong roi, hi mun renga hin jôk ta rei u.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua graprâng diktak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>“Keima graprâng diktak ki ni, male ka Pa chu ruhuon donsûipu ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Keima taka kop loi amachang ânra loi chu a khiekpaia, ânra kai chu a rithiel minsâi ngâi; masikin ânthienga amara atam uolna rangin. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Minchuna chong nangni ke pêk saia hin nin inthiengvar zoi ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Ko kôm omtit ungla, male kei khom nin kôm omtit ki tih. Amachang hah graperânga akop tit nônchu athenin inra thei maka; graperânga akop tit vaiin kêng ânra thei ngâi. Ma anghan nangni khom ko kôm nin omtit nônchu nin thenin inra thei no tunui.”<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>“Keima graprâng ki nia, nangni ngei ha amachangngei nin ni. Tukhom keima taka aomtita, male kei khom ama taka ko omtitna chu tamtakin an inra ngâi; keima boiin ite nin sin thei loi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Tukhom keima taka om loi chu amachang angin paiin aoma, male achâr ngâi; ma anga amachangngei hah chu an rokhôma meia an paia, akâng ngâi. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Ko kôm nin omtita, ko chong nin kôm aomtitin chu nin nunuom zong roi man bang nin tih. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Tamtaka nin inra hin ka Pa roiinpuina inlangin aom ngâi ani; ma anghan ku ruoisingei nin hong ni ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>Pa'n mi lungkham anghan kei khom nangni ku lungkham ani; ku lungkhamna hin omtit roi. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Ko chongpêkngei nin jômin chu ku lungkhamna ombang nin tih, ka Pa chongpêkngei ko jôma a lungkhamnân ko ombang anghin.<verse eid="JHN 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>“Ka râisâna nangnia han aom theina rang le nin râisâna akip theina rangin mahi nin kôm ki misîr ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>Ko chongpêk chu mahi ani: inkhat le inkhat inlungkham inlôm roi, keiman nangni ku lungkham anghin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Joh 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:17">15:17</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:23">1 Joh 3:23</ref>; <ref loc="2JN 1:5">2 Joh 5</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Miriemin a malngei ranga lungkhamna lientak a dôn thei chu an ta ranga a ringna pêk hi ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Male ko chongpêk nin jômin chu ka malngei nin ni. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>Tîrlâmngei nangni ti khâi no ning, asikchu tîrlâmngei chu an pu sintho riet ngâi mak ngei ani. Manêkin chu malngei nangni ti ki tih, Pa renga ki riet ngei murdi nangni ki misîr pe zoi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Nangnin ni thang mak choia; keiman kêng nangni ka thang ania; sea mara tamtak va dôna, nin mara aom bang rangin nangni ku phun sa ani. Masikin ki riminga Pa kôm nin zong kai chu nangni a pêk theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>Hanchu, mahi ko chongpêk chu ani: inkhat le inkhat inlungkham inlôm roi.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rammuol mumâkna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>“Rammuolin nangni mumâkin chu, keima mi lei mumâk bak ani ti riettit roi. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Rammuol ta ni ungla chu rammuolin ama ta angin nangni lungkham rang ani. Aniatachu rammuol renga nangni ka thangsuok ania, rammuol mi nin ni khâi loi sikin rammuolin nangni a mumâk ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>‘Suokngei chu an pu nêkin lien uol mak ngei’ ti chong nangni ki ril hah riettit roi. Mingeiin keima an nuom minlôn chu nangni khom an nunuom nangni lô sa an tih; ki minchuna chong an donin chu nin minchuna chong khom don an tih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24">Mat 10:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luk 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Joh 13:16</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Hannirese hima ngei murdi hah kata nin ni sika kêng nin chunga an tho rang; tumo mi tîrpu hah an riet loi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Keima juongin an kôm thurchi misîr no rong chu sietnân theiloi an chang loi rang piel ani; atûn chu an sietna muduolna rang dôn khâi mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Tukhom mi mumâkpu chu ka Pa khom a mumâk ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Mi dangin an la tho ngâiloi neinunngei hah an lâia tho no ronga chu sietna sikin theiloi an chang loi rang piel ania; atûn chu ki sintho ngei an mua, male keima le ka Pa kin ruonin min mumâk zoi ani. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Nikhomrese, mahi, an Balam lekhabua anni ngei han, ‘Ite abi boiin min mumâk,’ tia ânziek hah inzomin ahongtung adik theina ranga an tho ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 35:19">Lap 35:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 69:4">69:4</ref> </char></note><verse eid="JHN 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>“Sanpu hah juong a ta, Ratha diktak Pathien chungroia chongtak minlangpu hah Pa kôm renga juong atih. Pa kôm renga nin kôm juongtîr ka ta, male ama'n ku chungroi misîr atih. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Male nangni, khomin ku chungroi misîr sâng nin tih, aphut renga keima leh nin om sikin.<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>“Nin taksônna nin mâk loina rangin mahi nangni ki misîr pe ani. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Synagogngei renga nangni la khâipai an ta, nangni that ranga bôk ngei han Pathien sin an tho anga an inbe zora la tung atih. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Mingeiin nin chunga hima anghan la thông an tih, Pa le keima min riet loi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>Hannirese mahi nin kôm ke lei misîr ani, masikin ma neinunngei tho ranga an zora ahong tung tikin, nangni ke lei misîr pe zoi ti nin riettit theina rangin.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Ratha Inthieng sintho</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Hi neinunngei hih aphut renga nangni ka la ril loi ani, nin kôma ka la om sikin. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Aniatachu, atûn chu mi tîrpu kôm ke se rang kêng ani zoi, hannoma nin lâia tutên ke sena rang merkel mak chei. <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Male atûn nangni ki misîr pe lechu nin mulungngei dûkin asip zoi ani. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Aniatachu chongdiktak nangni ki ril: ke se hah nangni rangin chu asa uol ani, ke se nônchu Sanpu hah nin kôm juong no nih. Hannirese ke sên chu ama hah nin kôm juongtîr ki tih. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Male a juong tung tika chu sietna tieng mo, chong dika mo, Pathien roijêkna tieng mo theiloi an chang tie hah rammuol mingei kôm min mûng atih. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Sietna tieng theiloi an chang ani, keima min iem loi sikin; <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>chong dika khom theiloi an chang ani, Pa kôm ke se rang sik le mi nin mu khâi loi rang sikin; <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>male roijêkna tieng khom adikloi an chang ani, hi rammuol roijêkpu khom jêkin aom zoi sikin.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>“Nangni misîr pe rang tamtak ka la dôn, aniatachu atûna rangin chu ariet nangni lântak pe rai atih. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Nikhomrese, Ratha, Pathien chongtak minlang ngâipu hah a juong tika chu chongtak ngei murdia nangni ruoi min lût atih. Ama rachamin ite misîr no nia, a riet ha kêng a misîr rang male ahong tung rang neinunngei ha nangni ril atih. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>Ama han roiinpuina mi pêk atih, ko chong ti ngei hah lâk a ta, nangni a ril rang sikin. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Ka Pa'n a dôn ngei murdi chu kata ani; masika han kêng Ratha han ke pêk hah lâk a ta male nangni ril atih, ki ti ani.<verse eid="JHN 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Inngûina le tâina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>“Chomoltên chu mi mu khâi no tunuia, male chomolte suole chu mi mu nôk nin tih,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>A ruoisingei senkhatin anninanâkin annin rekela, “Ei kôma a thurchi misîr hi imo a tina? Chomolte chu mi mu no tunuia, chomolte suole chu mi mu nôk nin tih; a tia male, ‘Pa kôm ke se rang sikin’ khom a ti hi, an tia. <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>‘Chomolte’ a ti hih imo a tina? A misîr hih ei riet thei loi kêng!” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Jisua'n ama chong rekel rang an jôt ti a rieta, an kôm, “Chomolte chu mi mu no tunuia, chomolte suole chu mi mu nôk nin tih,” ki ti ha mo nangni nanâkin ni nin rekel inlôm? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>Chong diktak nangni ki ril: nangni chu chap le inrûmin om nin ta, hannirese, rammuol chu tâi atih; inngûiin om nin ta, aniatachu nin inngûina hah tâinân ânthûl rang ani. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Nupangin nâiha a tuong lâitak chu ân ngûikhak ngâi, a dûktongna zora ahong tung pe sikin; aniatachu nâi a nei suole chu a dûktong hah a mingil nôk ngâi, nâite rammuola juong suok hah a râisânpui sikin. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Nangni khom ma anghan nin ni: atûn chu inngûiin nin oma, aniatachu nangni mu nôk ki tih, nin mulungrîl râisânnân la sip atih. Ma râisânna ha chu tutên nangni sut thei khâi no ni ngei.<verse eid="JHN 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>“Ma nikhuo hah ahong tungin chu ite mi rekel khâi no tunui. Chongdiktak nangni ki ril: ki riminga nin zong kai chu Pa'n nangni pêk atih.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:23: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ki riminga nin zong kai chu Pa'n nangni pêk atih; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">i-ih khom Pa nin zongin chu, maha ama'n ki rimingin nangni pêk atih.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Atûn tena chu ite ki rimingin la zong mak choia; zong ungla man nin tih, nin râisânna akip theina rangin.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rammuol menena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>“Ha neinunngei hah mintêknangei chongin nin kôm ki misîr ani. Aniatachu, mintêknangei chong mang loiin ânlangiemin Pa chungroi ha nin kôm ki misîr zora ala hong tung rang. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Ma nikhuo hah ahong tungin chu, ki rimingin Pa kôm zong nin ta; male keiman Pa kôm nin ruthûlin nangni zong pe ki tih ki tina nimaka, <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Pa lelê han nangni a lungkham ngâi. Keima mi nin lungkham sik le Pathien renga juong ki ni, ti mi nin iem sikin nangni a lungkham ngâi ani. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>Pa kôm renga ku juonga, male rammuola ku juong ani; male atûn chu rammuol mâkin Pa kôm ke se nôk rang ani zoi,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>Hanchu a ruoisingei han a kôm, “Atûn chu ânlangiemin ni misîra, mintêknangei chong reng mang khâi mak chea. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Atûn chu neinuntin ni riet let tiin kin riet zoi; tute kôm ite ne rekel ngei rang nâng mak che. Hima sika hin Pathien renga juong ni ni tiin kin iem zoi ani,” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Atûn chu nin iem mo zoi? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Azora ahong tungtir zoi, anâikik zoi, matikin chu chekinchâi var nin ta, nin in, nin ina se nin ta, ke theivaiin mi mâkrak nin tih. Hannirese Pa hah ko kôm aom sikin ke theivaiin chu ni no ning. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>Masikin keima leh inpumkhata omin rathânngamna nin dôn theina rangin hi chong hih nangni ki misîr pe ani. Rammuolin intak nangni min tuong atih. Hannirese hâitakin om roi! Keiman rammuol ke mene zoi ani,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua'n a ruoisingei rang a chubai ngâi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>Jisua'n ma chong hih a ti suole chu invân tieng a tanga, “Pa, azora atung zoi. Na nâipasal kôm roiinpuina pêk ta roh. Nâipasal khomin roiinpuina nang a pêk theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>Mingei murdi chunga rachamneina ama ne pêka, masikin ama khomin ne pêk ngei kôm kumtuong ringna a pêk ngei theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Male kumtuong ringna ti chu, nangma Pathien diktak vai nang riet, le ni tîrpu, Jisua Khrista riet hih ani. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>No roiinpuina pilchunga ki minlanga; sintum mi ni pêk khom ki sin suozoi ani. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>Pa! atûn no kôm ngêt han roiinpuina ni pêk roh, rammuol insieng mâna no kôma roiinpuina ko dôn ngâi dên ha.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>“Rammuol renga mi ni pêk ngei kôm ni riming ku phuong minzar zoi. Anni ngei hah nata an nia, male nangman kêng anni ngei ha mi ni pêka, no chong an don zoia, <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>male atûn chu neinun mi ni pêk ngei murdi hih nangma renga ani ti an riet zoi. <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>Nangman chong mi ni pêk ngei khom ke pêk ngeia an pom zoia; no kôm renga juong ki ni khom an riet minthâr zoi, male mi ni tîr ani ti khom an iem zoi ani.<verse eid="JHN 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>“Anni rang piela chubaitho ki ni. Rammuol rangin chubaitho mu unga, nangma nata, keima mi ni pêk ngei ta ranga ani. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Ko dôn ngei murdi nata an nia; no dôn ngei murdi khom kata an nia, male ko roiinpuina khom anni renga ânlang ngâi ani. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>Atûn chu no kôm ko hong rang ani zoia; rammuola om khâi noning, aniatachu anni ngei chu rammuola la om an tih. Pa Inthieng! anni ngei hi ni riming sinthotheinân sanmojôk ngei roh, riming mi ni pêk lehan,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ni riming sinthotheinân sanmojôk ngei roh, riming mi ni pêk lehan; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ni riming sinthotheinân nangman mi ni pêk ngei ha sanmojôk ngei roh.</char></note> masikin keima le nangma pumkhat eini anghan anni ngei khom pumkhat anni theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>An kôm ko om sûngin chu ni riming sinthotheinân ka sanmojôk ngei ngâi, riming mi ni pêk lehan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ni riming sinthotheinân sanmojôkin ka dar ngei, riming mi ni pêk lehan; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ni riming sinthotheinân nangman mi ni pêk ngei ha sanmojôkin ka dar ngei.</char></note> Ku rung ngeia, inkhat luo inmang mak ngei, ânmang rang piela ompu tiloiin chu Pathien lekhabua ânziek ahong tung adik theina rang sikin. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Lap 41:9</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:18">Joh 13:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Atûn chu no kôm ko hong rang ani zoia, male rammuola hi neinunngei hih ki misîr pe ngeia ka râisânna an mulung sûngngeia akipdira aom theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>No chongbê ke pêk ngeia, male rammuolin a mumâk ngei zoia, rammuol mi an ni khâiloi sikin, keima rammuol mi ki ni loi anghan. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>Rammuol renga lâk pai ngei rangin nang zong mu unga, Asaloi Inkhat renga sanmojôk ngei rangin nang ke ngên ani. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Keima rammuol mi ki ni loi anghin anni khom rammuol mi nimak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Anni ngei hih chongtakin minthâr ngei roh; no chong chu chongtak ani. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Rammuola mi ni tîr anghan, kei khomin anni ngei hih rammuola ki tîr ngei ani. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>Anni sikin no kôm kên thâra, anni ngei khom no kôm, adiktaka an inthâr theina rangin.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>“Hi ngei rang vaiin nang ngên mu unga, an thurchi misîr sika mi a iem ngei ta rang khomin nang ke ngên sa ani. <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>An rêngin pumkhat anni theina rangin nang ke ngên ani. Pa! Anni ngei hih ei kôm om rese ngei, nangma ko kôm no oma, keima khom no kôm ko om anghan. Pumkhatin om rese ngei, rammuolin mi ni tîr, ti an iem theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Roiinpuina mi ni pêk dên hah anni khom ke pêk ngei ani, nangma le keima pumkhat ei ni anghan pumkhat an ni theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>Keima, an kôma, nangma ko kôma omin an nin pumkhat tatakna rangin, hanchu mi ni tîr ani ti hih rammuolin riet an ta, male mi ni lungkham anghan anni ngei khom nu lungkham ngei tiin riet an tih.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>“Pa! anni ngei hih mi ni pêka, male ko omna an om sa theina rangin ku nuom ani, mi ni lungkham sika rammuol insieng mâna mi ni pêk roiinpuina hah an mu theina rangin. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>Pa Diktak! rammuolin nang riet maka, hannirese keiman chu nang ki riet, male hi ngei khomin mi ni tîr ani tiin an riet. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>An kôm nang ki min riet ngeia, min riet ngei bang ki tih, mi ni lungkhamna hah an kôm aom theina rangin, male kei khom an kôm ko om sa theina rangin,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Jisua an sûr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mk 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>Jisua'n hi chubaithona hih a ti suole chu, a ruoisingei le Kidron Tuitedung rakânin an sea. Ma muna han ruhuon aoma, male Jisua le a ruoisingei asûnga an lûta. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>A minsûrpu Judas han hima mun hah a rieta, vêl tamtak Jisua le a ruoisingei, ha muna han an intûp ngâi sikin. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Masikin Judas han Roman râlmingei pâl leh, male Ochaisingei le Phariseengeiin an tîr, Temple rungpungei senkhat tuongin ma ruhuona han râlrovongei, châtingei le meiserngei chôiin an sea. <verse eid="JHN 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>A chunga ahong tung rang neinunngei murdi hah Jisua'n a lei riet sai piel ani sikin moton tieng a hong nâia, “Tumo nin rok?” tiin a rekel ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>“Nazareth Jisua,” tiin an thuona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">“Keima hih ki ni,” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:5">A minsûr rangpu Judas, khom an kôla ândinga. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Jisua'n, “Keima hih ki ni,” a ti lehan an nûk tieng an intôla, nuoia an inlet raka. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Avêlin Jisua'n an kôm, “Tumo nin rôk?” tiin a rekel ngei nôka,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:7">“Nazareth Jisua” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Keima ki ni, nangni ki tipe zoi ngah. Ma anghan keima mi nin rok anîn chu adangngei chu se ta rese ngei,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>(Jisua'n hima anga a tina tak chu, “Pa, mi ni pêk ngei lâia inkhat luo minmang mu-ung, a lei ti hah ahong tung adikna ranga ani.”)<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Simon Peter'n, a khandai pêl hah a kaidûka, Ochai Inlaltak suokpa kuor a changtienga a lengthâk pea. Ha suokpa riming hah Malchus ani. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:39">Mat 26:39</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:36">Mk 14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:42">Luk 22:42</ref></char></note> Jisua'n Peter kôm, “Ne khandai hah akoka thun nôk ta roh! ka Pa'n tuongna kilât mi pêk hih ke nêk loi rangin ni mindon mo?” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Annas makunga Jisua ânding</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Hanchu Roman râlmingei pâla an ulien inchungtak leh Juda mi rungpungeiin Jisua an sûra, an khita, <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>male Annas kôm an tuong baka. Ama hah Caiaphas tarpu ania, Caiaphas hah ma kum han Ochai Inlaltak ani. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Mi murdi ruthûlin mi inkhat thi hah asa uol, tia Juda rachamneipungei kôma rilpu hah Caiaphas hih ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:49">Joh 11:49</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 11:50">50</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter'n Jisua a ipdelna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26:69-70</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mk 14:66-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simon Peter le ruoisi dang han Jisua an jûia. Ha ruoisi dang hah Ochai Inlaltak mêlriet ani sikin Ochai Inlaltak khalâidung dênin Jisua a se puia. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Peter chu mokot pêntieng a lei oma. Hanchu ruoisi dang han pêntieng a jôk nôka, mokota om dôngmate hah a chongpuia, male Peter sûng tieng a hong minlûta. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Mokota om dôngmate han, “Nangma khom hima miriempa ruoisingei lâia mi inkhat nimak che mo?” tiin a rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:17">“Nimak, keima chu ni mu-ung,” tiin Peter'n a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Adâi sikin tîrlâmngei le rungpungei han rohol leh mei an thoa, inding chungin an uota. Hanchu Peter khom a sea, an kôla vân dingin mei ava uota.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ochai Inlaltakin Jisua chong a rekelnangei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mk 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Ochai Inlaltak han Jisua kôm a ruoisingei thurchi le a minchu ngâi chungroi a rekela. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Jisua'n a thuona, “Zoratin mi murdi rietin thurchi ki misîr ngâia; Synagogngeia le Biekina, mipui intûpna ki minchu ngâia. Inrûkin ite reng misîr ngâi mu-ung. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Masikin, ithomo keima mi ni rekela? Ku thurchi misîr a riet ngei rekel roh ba. Imo ki misîr pe ngei ngâi an riet ngah,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Jisua'n hima anga a chong lâitakin ha taka om mi rungngâi inkhatin a bêna, a kôm, “Kho angngân mo Ochai Inlaltak hih hima anghan no chongpui ngama?” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Ki ti minchâina aom duoiin chu, maha imo ani hi muna mipuingei hih ril roh. Aniatachu ki ti mindikin chu, ithomo ni ni bêna?” tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 18:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Male Annas han khit pumin ama hah Ochai Inlaltak Caiaphas kôm a tîr zoia.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Peter'n Jisua a ipdel nôkna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:71-75">Mat 26:71-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:69-72">Mk 14:69-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:58-62">Luk 22:58-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Peter chu mei uotin a lân ding banga. Hanchu midangngeiin a kôm, “Nangma khom a ruoisingei lâia inkhatlam hah nimak che mo?” an tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:25">Hannirese, Peter'n a ipdela, “Kei chu ni mu-ung,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Ochai Inlaltak suok Peter'n a kuor a lengthâk pe sûngsuokpa han Peter kôm, “Ruhuon sûnga han a kôm nang ku mu nimak mo?” tiin a rekela.<verse eid="JHN 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Avêlin Peter'n, “Ni mu-ung” a ti nôka, male chu âr akhuong kelen zoi.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Pilat makunga ânding</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mat 27:1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Mk 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Jînga inmânin Jisua hah Caiaphas in renga Rom râiôt ina an tuonga. Juda rachamneipungei chu balam angin ânthiengin Kalkân kût ruolhoia sâk, sâk rang an nuom sikin râiôt ina lût mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Masikin Pilat tuol pêntieng ava jôka an kôm, “Hi mi hih imo nin nônna?” tiin a rekel ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Annin an thuon chu, “Hi mi hin ite tho minchâina dôn no senla chu no kôm hong tuong no ni ung.”<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilat'n an kôm, “Nônchu nangnin tuong ungla nin balam angin a chungroi jêk roi,” a tipe ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:31">Anni ngei han, “Kin balamin tute that rangin mi phal mak,” tiin an thuona. <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>(Jisua'n a thi rang thurchi a lei misîr hah ahong tung dikna rangin ha ngei hah ahong om ani.)<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:14">Joh 3:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:32">12:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Pilat hah a in sûnga a lût nôka male Jisua a koia, “Judangei rêngpa mo ni ni?” tiin a rekela.<verse eid="JHN 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Jisua'n, “Hi chong hih nangma nu mulung suoka mi ni rekel mo, mîn ku thurchi nang an misîr pe sika mo?” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilat'n a thuona, “Juda mi ani tiin mi ni mindon mo? Ni mingei nanâk le ochai inlal ngei kêng ku kut chunga nang hong pêk an ni, imo no tho pe ngei?”<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Ke Rêngram chu hi rammuol hih nimaka; hi rammuol hih ke Rêngram nisenla chu, ku nûkjûingeiin doi an ta, Juda rachamneipungei kuta pêkin om no ning. Ke Rêngram chu mahin nimak!” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 18:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Hanchu Pilat'n, “Rêngpa mo ni ni?” tiin a rekela,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:37">Jisua'n, “Nangman kêng rêngpa ni ni, ni na ti ngah. Kên zira male hi rammuola ku juongna abitak chu, chongtak misîr rang piel hih ani. Tukhom chongtaka om ngei kai chu ko chong an rangâi ngâi,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Male Pilat'n, “Chongtak hih imo?” tiin arkela.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Jisua hih thi rangin a roijêkmasat ani</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27:15-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mk 15:6-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Hanchu Pilat han tuol pêntieng a jôk nôka, mingei kôm han, “Theiloi mintumna rangin ite abi man mu-ung. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Hannirese nin balam anghan, Kalkân kût zorân mi ântâng inkhat nangni ko mojôk pe ngâia. Judangei rêngpa hih nangni mojôk pe ronga nin jôt mo?” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Anni ngei han iniek pumin a kôm, “Nuom mak meh, ama chu ni no rese! Barabbas ke kin nuom!” tiin an thuona. (Barabbas chu inru, mi khuolse ngei chunga kut lek ngâi ani.)<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Hanchu Pilat'n Jisua a tuonga, a jêma. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Râlmingeiin riling amachangngei hah lukhum an phana, male a lua an min khuma; hanchu kâncholiinchuol senduk an min haka, <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>male a kôm an honga, “Judangei Rêngpa ring sôt roh!” an tia, male an sea an bên zoi.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilat han pêntieng vêlkhat ava jôk nôka, mipuingei kôm, “En ta u, theiloi mintumna rangin ite a sietna abi man mu-ung, ti nangni min riet rangin nin kôm ka la hong tuong rang ani,” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Masikin riling lukhum inkhumin, kâncholiinchuol senduk hakin Jisua a hong jôka. Pilat'n an kôm, “En roi! Hi miriem hi!” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Ochaisingei le Biekin rungpungei an hong mu lehan an hêtsana, “Khrosa jêmdel roh, khrosa jêmdel roh,” an tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:6">Pilat'n an kôm, “Nônchu tuong ungla nangnin khrosa jêmdel roi. Theiloi mintumna rangin ite a sietna bi man mu-ung,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Mipuingei han, “Pathien Nâipasalin ânbê sikin a thi rang ani, ti balam kin dôn ani,” tiin an thuon nôka.<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Ma chong hah Pilat'n a rietin chu a chi uol nôk zoia. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>In sûnga a lût nôka, Jisua kôm, “Kho renga hong mo ni ni?” tiin a rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:9">Aniatachu Jisua'n thuon maka. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pilat'n a kôm, “Ni na thuon loi rang mo? Nang mojôk theina le nang jêmdel theina rachamneina ko dôn ti hi riettit roh,” a tipea.<verse eid="JHN 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Pathien'n nang a pêk sika vaiin kêng ku chunga rachamneina no dôn ani. Masikin nu kuta mi hong bangpu chu a sietna arik uol ok ani,” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Pilat'n ma chong hah a rietin chu Jisua a mojôk theina rang lam a mindonna. Aniatachu mipuingeiin an hêtsana, “No mojôkin chu Rêng mal nimak che! Tutu khom rênga ânbê kai chu Rêng doia ânhel an ni!” an tia.<verse eid="JHN 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>Ma chongngei hah Pilat'n a rietin chu Jisua pêntieng a tuonga male roijêkpu sukmuna “Lungdâp” (Hebrew chongin “Gabbatha”) an tia han ânsunga. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Hima nikhuo hah Kalkân kût ranga incherêlni ania, sûnchimrip dôr ani. Pilat'n mingei kôm han, “Mahin nin rêngpa aom!” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>An hêtsan nôka, “That roh! That roh! khrosa jêmdel roh!” an tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Pilat'n an kôm, “Nin rêngpa khrosa jêmdel rangin mi nin nuom mo?” tiin a rekel ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:15">Ochaisingei han, “Caesar vai kêng rêng kin dôn!” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="JHN 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Hanchu Pilat'n Jisua hah khrosa jêmdel rangin an kut chunga a bâng zoi ani.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Jisua jêmdelin aom</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mk 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Masikin Jisua ha an tuong zoia. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>Jisua a khros ruputin “Luru Mun” (Hebrew chongin “Golgotha”) an ti dênin a sea. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Ma mun han khrosa an jêmdela; male midang inik an jêmdel sa, voi le changa, alâitaka Jisua. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilat'n minrietna a mizieka, “Nazareth Jisua, Judangei Rêngpa,” tiin khros lêra a târa. <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Jisua an jêmdelna mun hah khopuilien renga ala loi sikin mi tamtakin an porea. Minrietna hah Hebrew chong, Latin chong le Greek chongin miziek ani. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Ochaisingei han Pilat kôm, “Judangei Rêngpa” tiin miziek no roh, ama'n kêng, “Judangei Rêngpa ki ni a ti,” an tipea.<verse eid="JHN 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilat'n, “Ki miziek sai chu miziekin aom ani zoi.” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Râlmingei han Jisua an jêmdel suole chu a puonngei an lâka tum minlin an sema, an taka tum khat an changa. A kâncholiinchuol khom an lâka, maha sûiloi kâncholia không ani. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Râlmingei han, “Khêr no u; tho, tumo a chang rang taruosân ei ti u.” inkhat le inkhat annin tia. Pathien lekhabua ânziek hah ahongtung adik theina rangin ha ngei hah ahong om ani:<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Lap 22:18</ref> </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 19:24">“Anni ngei han ku puon ki dier annin sema</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JHN 19:24">male ka kâncholiinchuol rangin taruo an sâna.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JHN 19:24">Male ma anghin râlmingei han an tho zoi ani.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Jisua khros kôla ânding ngei chu a nû, a nû zuorpuinu, Clopas lômnu Mary, le Mary Magdalene ngei an ni. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Jisua'n a nû le a lungkham ngâipu a ruoisi hah a kôla an inding a mua; masikin a nû kôm han, “Ama hih na nâipasal ani,” a tipea.<verse eid="JHN 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>Hanchu a ruoisi kôm han khom, “Amanu hih nu nû ani,” a tipea. Ma zora renga ha chu a ruoisi han hanu hah a ina om rangin a tuong zoi ani.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua Thina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mk 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Jisua'n atûn chu neinunngei murdi ânzoi suo zoi ti a rieta; male Pathien lekhabua ânziek ahong tung adik theina rangin, “Ku tui ânrâl,”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Lap 69:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 22:15">22:15</ref> </char></note> a tia.<verse eid="JHN 19:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Ma muna han uain thûra sip khuriâi inkhat aoma, sponge uaina an michie, hyssop khiengrol le an târra, a mûr an hong min tôna. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Jisua'n uain thûr ha a nêk suole chu, “Ahek zoi!” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:30">Hanchu a lu a juon kûna a rangachat zoi.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua kângrâm an sun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Hanchu ma nikhuo hah Sûnrangngani ania, Juda rachamneipungeiin Sabbathnia khros lêra ruok aom tit rang hah an nuom loi sikin mi an jêmdel ngei kengei hah khiek rangin, le an ruokngei khrosngei renga musum rangin Pilat kôm phalna an ngêna, ahong tung rang Sabbathni ha aliekin ânthieng ani sikin. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Masikin râlmingei hah an sea, Jisua leh munkhata an jêmdel tong masapu le midang inkhatpu kengei hah an khieka. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Aniatachu Jisua kôla an hongin chu athi saiin an hong mua, masikin a kengei chu khiek mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Râlmi inkhatin Jisua kângrâm isei leh a hong sunna, harenghan thisen le tui a juong suok zoia. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>(Masikin hi neinun a mupu hin nangni khom nin iemna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:35: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">iem; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ti hih miziek senkhatngeiin chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">iem titna rangin </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tiin an dôn.</char></note> rangin a misîr ani. A misîr hih adika, male chongtak ani ti khom a riet ani.) <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Pathien lekhabua, “A rungei inkhat luo khiek ni no nih.” tia ânziek hah ahong tung adik theina rangin hima hah ahong om ani.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:46">Jôk 12:46</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:12">Tel 9:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:20">Lap 34:20</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Pathien lekhabu mun danga, “Mingei han an sunna hah la en an tih,” a ti sa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zak 12:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Chph 1:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua an phûm</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mk 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Masuole chu, Arimathea khuoa mi Joseph han Pilat kôm Jisua ruok hah lâk rangin a ngêna. (Joseph hah Juda rachamneipungei chi sika inrûka Jisua nûkjûipu ani.) Pilat'n ruok hah chôi thei rangin a phal pea, masikin Joseph'n a chôia a se pui zoi ani. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>Nicodemus, motona jâna Jisua kôma lei hongpu han mirimhoi myrrh le aloe ânpol kilogram sômthum dôr chôiin Joseph a jûi sa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:39: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JON 3:1">Jon 3:1</ref>,<ref loc="JON 3:2">2</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Ha pasal inik ngei han Jisua ruok ha an chôia, Judangei inphûm ngâi balam angin mirimhoi le puoninnêm leh an tuoma. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Jisua an thatna muna han ruhuon inkhat aoma, ma ruhuon sûng han tute an lân phûmna ngâiloi thân thar inkhat aoma. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Judangei Sabbathni rang motona sûn ani sika le thân ha anâi sikin, mahan Jisua ruok hah an phûm zoi ani.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Thân akorong</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mat 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mk 16:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Pathienni jînga, ala jîng mumuokin, Mary Magdalene thâna a sea, thân kotbâia lung hah muluoipai saiin ava mua. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>Simon Peter le ruoisi dang Jisua'n a lungkham ngâipu, kôm han a tâna, male an kôm, “Thân renga Pumapa hah an lâk paia, male an darna riet khâi mak me,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 20:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Hanchu Peter le ruoisi dang hah thâna an sea. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Anruonin an tâna, aniatachu ruoisi dang hah Peter a khêl pita thâna a tung masa ani. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>Ân kûna male puoninnêm zuot a mua, hannirese asûnga chu lût mak. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Anûka Simon Peter a juonga male thân sûnga a lût pata. Puoninnêm zuot chu a mua <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>male Jisua lu tuomna puon ha chu puoninnêm zuot leh munkhatin om loiin atheia ânzuotin ava mua. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Hanchu ruoisi dang, thâna tung masapu khom hah ava lûta; a mua male a iem zoi. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>(Pathien lekhabu'n thina renga lân thoinôk atih, ti hah la riet thei uol mak ngei ani.) <verse eid="JHN 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Hanchu ruoisingei hah an ina an kîr nôk zoi.<verse eid="JHN 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mary magdalene kôm Jisua ânlâr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mk 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Mary chu chap pumin thân pêntieng ândinga, chap chungin ân kûna, thân sûng a vênga <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>male vântîrton inik angoia invôn Jisua ruok an min jâlna luthun tieng inkhat kethuon tieng inkhat an insung a mua. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Ha ngei han, “Nupangnu, ithomo na chapa?” tiin an rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:13">Amanu han, “Ku Pumapa an lâk paia, khonmo an darna riet khâi mu-ung!” tiin a thuon ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>Hanchu amanu ha a hônheiin chu mahan Jisua ânding a mua; hannirese amanu ha Jisua ani tiin riet mak. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Nupangnu, ithomo na chapa? Tumo no rok?” tiin a rekela.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:15">Amanu han ruhuon donsûipu mini tiin a bôka, a kôm, “Pu, ama hah na lâkin chu khonmo na dar mi ril roh, sêng ka ta, ama ka va lâk theina rangin,” amanu han a tia.<verse eid="JHN 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Jisua'n amanu kôm han, “Mary!” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:16">Amanu han a tieng mâi a thaka, Hebrew chongin, “Rabboni!” amanu han a tia. (Maha “Minchupu” tina ani.) <verse eid="JHN 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Jisua'n amanu kôm han, “Mi mutu sôt no roh, asikchu ka Pa kôm la se nôk mu-ung. Hannirese ka lâibungngei kôm sênla, ka Pa an Pa, ka Pathien an Pathien kôm ki kîr nôk rang ani zoi tiin va ril ngei roh,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Masikin Mary Magdalene hah a sea, male Pumapa a mu tie le an inkaina a ril ngei hah ruoisingei ava misîr pe ngei zoi.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua a Ruoisingei kôm ânlâr</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Ha Pathienni kholoia han, Juda rachamneipungei an chi sikin ruoisingei hah insûnga inkhâr kalin an intûpa. Hanchu Jisua a honga an lâia ândinga, “Nin lâia rathânngamna om rese!” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>Mahi a ti suole chu a kutngei le a kângrâm a min mu ngeia. Pumapa an mua, ruoisingei ha râisânnân an sip zoia. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Avêlin Jisua'n an kôm, “Nin chunga rathânngamna om rese. Pa'n mi tîr anghan kei khomin nangni ki tîr ani,” a tipe ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>Hanchu ratha a mûtkhum ngeia male an kôm, “Ratha Inthieng man roi. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Mingei sietnangei khom nin ngâidam kai chu ngâidamin om an ta; nin ngâidam loi kai chu ngâidamin om no ni ngei,” a tia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Mat 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:18">18:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua le Thomas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Jisua a hong lâihan ruoisi sômleinik ngei lâia Thomas (Ânphîr an ti) ha chu an lâia omaka. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Masikin ruoisi dangngei han, “Pumapa kin mu zoi!” an tipea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:25">Thomas'n an kôm, “A kuta peret sâbenûkngei ku mu noa male a sâbenûkngei ha ku kutruol leh ki khîk noa, a kângrâma sâbenûkngei khom ko tôn nônchu iem no ning,” a tia.<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Hapta khat suole chu ruoisingei hah insûnga an intûp nôka, Thomas khom an kôm a om sa. Inkhârngei hah an kala, aniatachu Jisua a honga, an lâia ândinga, an kôm, “Nin chunga rathânngamna om rese,” a tia. <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>Hanchu Thomas kôm, “Nu kutruol leh mahin khîk inla, male ku kutngei hi en roh; hanchu ka kângrâm khom nu kut sônin pûr inla tôn roh. Iemzoiloiin om khâi nônla, male iem ta roh!” a tipea.<verse eid="JHN 20:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Thomas'n a kôm, “Ku Pumapa le ka Pathien ni ni!” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Mi ni mu sika ni iem mini? Mi mu loia mi iem ngei chu satvur ani bak na!” a tipea.<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hi lekhabu'n akhîn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Jisua'n a ruoisingei mitmu chunga sininkhêl dang tamtak ngei a thoa, mangei hah hi lekhabu sûng hin miziek nimak. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Hannirese Jisua hih Messiah, Pathien Nâipasal ani ti nin iem<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:31: </char><char style="fq" closed="false">iem; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">miziek senkhat ngei an dôn chu </char><char style="fq" closed="false">iem titna rangin.</char></note> theina rang le ama nin iemna sika ringna nin dôn theina ranga hingei hi chu miziek ani.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Ruoisingei sari kôma Jisua ânlâr</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Masuole chu, Tiberias dîla a ruoisingei kôm Jisua ânlâr nôka. Hi anghin neinun ahongtunga. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simon Peter, Thomas (Ânphîr an ti) Nathanael (Galilee ram Cana mi), Zebedee nâipasalngei le Jisua ruoisi dang inik ngei anrêngin an intûpa. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simon Peter'n adangngei kôm, “Nga sûr rangin se ki tih,” a tia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:5">Luk 5:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:3">Anni han a kôm, “Keini khom juong sa kin tih,” an tipea. Masikin rukuonga an se zoia, aniatachu hani jâna han chu ite man mak ngei. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Nisa ahong suokin chu Jisua tuipanga ândinga, aniatachu ruoisingei han Jisua ani ti riet mak ngeia. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Hanchu Jisua'n an kôm, “Ruothartengei, ite man mak chei mo?” tiin a rekel ngeia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:5">“Ite man mak me” tiin an thuona.<verse eid="JHN 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>Ama'n an kôm, “Rukuong changtieng han nin lên ha vôr ungla male man nin tih,” a tipe ngeia. Masikin an lên hah an vôra nga an man tam rai sikin rukuong sûnga kai nôk thei khâi mak ngeia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:6">Luk 5:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="JHN 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Jisua'n a lungkham ngâipu ruoisi han Peter kôm, “Pumapa kêng ani ngaso!” a tipea. Peter'n Pumapa ke ani ti a rietin chu a puon a bomduopa (korongin aom ani sikin) male tuia ânchôm zoia. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Ruoisi dangngei chu rukuong leh tuirakham tieng an honga, lêna nga sipmatin an kaisuoa, tâng renga hah la bâk maka meter razakhat dôr ani. <verse eid="JHN 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Tuirakham an hong suokin chu rohol leh mei tho, le achunga nga le vâipôl alekti aom an hong mua. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Hanchu Jisua'n an kôm, “Atûn renga nin nga sûr senkhat hah hin hong chôi ta u,” a tipe ngeia.<verse eid="JHN 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simon Peter'n rukuonga chuongin nga lienpapa lên sipmatin tânga a kaisuoa, anrêngin razakhat sômrangnga inthum ani; madôra nga tam khom nisenla lên chu chet mak. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Jisua'n an kôm, “Hong ungla, sâk roi” a tipe ngeia. Ruoisingei lâia tutên “Tumo ni ni?” ti luo rekel ngam mak ngei Pumapa ani tiin an riet minthâr sikin. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Hanchu Jisua a sea, vaîpôl a lâka a sem pe ngeia, ma angdên han nga khom a sem pe ngei nôka.<verse eid="JHN 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Ma hah Jisua'n thina renga ânthoinôk suole a ruoisingei kôma ânlâr avoithumna ani.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua le Peter</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>An sâk suole chu Jisua'n Simon Peter kôm, “Simon John nâipasal, hi adangngei min lungkham nêkin mi ni lungkham uol mo?” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Ama'n a kôm, “O, Pumapa, nang ku lungkham tiin ni riet,” tiin a thuona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:15">Jisua'n a kôm, “Ke belringei donsûi roh,” a tipea. <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>Avoiniknân Jisua'n a kôm, “Simon John nâipasal, mi ni lungkham mo?” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">“O, Pumapa, nang ku lungkham ti ni riet,” tiin a thuona.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:16">Jisua'n a kôm, “Ke belringei donsûi roh,” a tipea. <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>Avoithumnân Jisua'n a kôm, “Simon John nâipasal, mi ni lungkham mo?” a tipea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jisua'n vêlthum, “Mi ni lungkham mo?” tiin a rekel sikin Peter ahong innguikhak zoia, masikin, “Pumapa neinuntin ni riet leta; nang ku lungkham ti khom ni riet!” a tia.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:17">Jisua'n a kôm, “Ke belri donsûi roh. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>Chongdiktak nang ki ril: na nâipang lâihan chu nên thoka nu nuomna titieng ne se thei ngâia; aniatachu ulien ni ni tikin chu nu kutngei mazar na ta, tûn mini nang khit pe an ta nu nuom loina titieng nang tuong an tih,” a tipea. <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>(Hi chong hih Jisua'n a ti pena chu Pathien roiinpuina rangin Peter thi rang tie rietna ranga ani.) Hanchu Jisua'n a kôm, “Mi jûi roh!” a tipea.<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jisua le Ruoisi dang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Peter a hônheiin chu ruoisi dang, Jisua'n a lungkham ngâipu, jânbu an nêk lâia Jisua tieng hôn ôna, “Pumapa, tumo nang a minsûr rang?” tia rekelpu hah a nûk a jûi a mua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:25">Joh 13:25</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Peter'n ama hah a mûn chu Jisua kôm, “Pumapa hipa hi rêkte imo a tho rang?” tiin a rekela.<verse eid="JHN 21:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Jisua'n a kôm, “Ku juong nôk mâka lei ring tit rangin nuom ngân inlang imo no lo rang? Mi jûi roh!” tiin a thuona.<verse eid="JHN 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Masikin ha ruoisi hah thi no nih tiin, Jisua nûkjûingei lâia ânthang zoi. Aniatachu Jisua'n thi no nih a tina nimaka; “Ku juong nôk mâka lei ring tit rangin nuom ngân inlang imo no lo rang?” kêng a ti ani.<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Ama hih ruoisi, hi neinunngei a tipu le a miziekpu khom ania; male a ti ngei khom hih adik ani tiin ei riet.<verse eid="JHN 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Chongkhârna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Atûn, Jisua sintho neinun dang tamtak aoma. Mangei murdi hah miziek var rang nisenla chu, mizieka om lekhabungei chu rammuol pumpui khom keng rangin minhoi mu-ung.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
